                    "endIndex": 8400,
                    "startIndex": 8129,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "First, the notion that all oil exports are halted is deeply flawed. In 2025 about 20mbpd of oil transited the Strait of Hormuz. Saudi Arabia has diverted 7mbpd to the Red Sea. Iraq is reactivating a 1.5mbpd pipeline that flows to Turkey. Prior to the start of the war...\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8129
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8401,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8401,
                    "startIndex": 8400,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8400
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8670,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8670,
                    "startIndex": 8401,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "... the world was facing a significant oil production surplus which was on track to hit 4mbpd in 2026. A lot of people forget this. So the world isn't down 20mbpd. It's down 20 - (7 + 1.5 + 4) = 7.5mbpd and that's before accounting for Iranian exports (about 1.5mbpd).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8401
            },
