            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9298,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9298,
                    "startIndex": 9289,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Via a VC\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9289
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9299,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9299,
                    "startIndex": 9298,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9298
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9366,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9366,
                    "startIndex": 9299,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I'm actively hiring right now so I want to push back on something.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9299
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9367,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9367,
                    "startIndex": 9366,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9366
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9567,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9567,
                    "startIndex": 9367,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "When a big company lets a few hundred people go, the CEO doesn't get up and say \"we over-hired in 2022 and made bad bets on headcount.\" That's the honest version. It also gets you fired by the board.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9367
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9568,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9568,
                    "startIndex": 9567,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9567
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9737,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9737,
                    "startIndex": 9568,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What they say instead is: \"AI makes us more efficient, so we're rightsizing.\" It sounds strategic. It's defensible. And it has just enough truth in it to be believable.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9568
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9738,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9738,
                    "startIndex": 9737,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9737
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9911,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9911,
                    "startIndex": 9738,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The problem is we've started treating those press releases as ground truth about where the industry is headed - and then drawing conclusions about the profession from them.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9738
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 9912,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 9912,
                    "startIndex": 9911,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9911
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10014,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10014,
                    "startIndex": 9912,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What I actually see on the ground in SF: most companies I know that are doing well are hiring A LOT. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 9912
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10015,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10015,
                    "startIndex": 10014,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10014
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10153,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10153,
                    "startIndex": 10015,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Because the demand for software isn't shrinking. If anything, we still have more software to build than we have people to build it well. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10015
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10154,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10154,
                    "startIndex": 10153,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10153
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10279,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10279,
                    "startIndex": 10154,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Junior roles are changing shape, yes. The work is shifting. But that's a different thing than mass contraction of the field.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10154
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10280,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10280,
                    "startIndex": 10279,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10279
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10358,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 10358,
                    "startIndex": 10280,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Pay attention to what companies are doing, not what they're saying about why.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 10280
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 10359,
              "paragraph": {
