              "endIndex": 12529,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 12529,
                    "startIndex": 12368,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "*a key test is if a model cannot improve its own output because it has made absolute optimum token predictions and weaved a perfect, golden fleece, on pass one.\n",
