            {
              "endIndex": 15567,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 15567,
                    "startIndex": 15161,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "“These are unprecedented times. The major Hardware OEMs first discussed the crunch in the memory market with our MS procurement team in late November 2025, signalling prices hikes to come. However, at the time, not even the vendors knew just how severe/dramatic it would be. Memory suppliers and Hardware vendors are increasingly prioritizing AI and hyperscaler demand over traditional enterprise demand.”\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
