                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23158,
                    "startIndex": 22743,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "> I’m beginning to be interested in reading the Tempo blockchain docs and using Privy, a semi-centralised wallet infra company from or associated with Tempo/Stripe. It feels to me like the idealism of blockchains has failed and it is coming of age in the reality of economic forces, notably distribution and network effects, consolidation and convenience, and that complexity and fragmentation held the ideas back.\n",
