              "endIndex": 23286,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23286,
                    "startIndex": 23176,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Jack Dorsey, co-founder of Twitter (now X) and Block, on why treating AI as a \"copilot\" is a losing strategy:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23176
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23287,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23287,
                    "startIndex": 23286,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23286
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23405,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23405,
                    "startIndex": 23287,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "@jack argues that most companies are approaching AI in a way that will make it nearly impossible for them to survive.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23287
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23406,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23406,
                    "startIndex": 23405,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23405
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23597,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23597,
                    "startIndex": 23406,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"I think most of the industry is thinking about AI as like a co-pilot, as something that is augmented onto, rather than like how do you just rebuild our whole company with this as the core.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23406
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23598,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23598,
                    "startIndex": 23597,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23597
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23751,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23751,
                    "startIndex": 23598,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "His concern is that bolting AI onto existing structures produces companies that look indistinguishable from each other, and from the AI labs themselves.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23598
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23752,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23752,
                    "startIndex": 23751,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23751
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23983,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23983,
                    "startIndex": 23752,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"If it doesn't make sense for your business to do that and you end up being or looking very similar or rhyming too closely with the frontier labs, then I think it's going to be very, very challenging to differentiate and survive.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23752
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 23984,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 23984,
                    "startIndex": 23983,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23983
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24087,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24087,
                    "startIndex": 23984,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This thinking has been driving his decisions since early 2024, when these tools \"really came to bear.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 23984
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24088,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24088,
                    "startIndex": 24087,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24087
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24234,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24234,
                    "startIndex": 24088,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That's when his team began building Goose, an agent coding harness, as part of a broader effort to rebuild around AI rather than layer it on top.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24088
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24235,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24235,
                    "startIndex": 24234,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24234
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24253,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24253,
                    "startIndex": 24235,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The core insight?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24235
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24254,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24254,
                    "startIndex": 24253,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24253
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24421,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24421,
                    "startIndex": 24254,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Speeding up old workflows with AI is a short-term gain every competitor will match. Real differentiation comes from rebuilding the company itself around intelligence.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24254
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 24422,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 24422,
                    "startIndex": 24421,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24421
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25285,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25285,
                    "startIndex": 24422,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Jack can be brilliant though I think he is a lousy operator. I keep thinking about what will not change. Relationships and networks. AI is not a disruptive innovation. It has not started out shitty but useful for a new trend, or has it? The fundamental shift has been towards technology companies which has been a revolution of organising people around problems, and also about the internet as a new platform, a new marketplace, a forum or town square, a city. AI is now like this. It is an employee. Can you arrange a start-up around an artificial employee? What does that mean? If you consider AI as a multi capable person, you're saying you're reorienting your company around a person? That just means providing the hooks and systems to this new type of person. And that means rewriting software, just as the web and the smartphone meant rewriting software.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 24422
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25286,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25286,
                    "startIndex": 25285,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25285
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25288,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25288,
                    "startIndex": 25286,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25286
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25289,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25289,
                    "startIndex": 25288,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25288
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25390,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25390,
                    "startIndex": 25289,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "MIT student asked a question earlier today that a lot of young founders are quietly wondering about:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25289
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25391,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25391,
                    "startIndex": 25390,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25390
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25437,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25437,
                    "startIndex": 25391,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"Won’t the frontier labs just do everything?\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25391
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25438,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25438,
                    "startIndex": 25437,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25437
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25574,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25574,
                    "startIndex": 25438,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Yes it's true that OAI/Ant are shipping at incredible pace, but it's quite easy to avoid their blast radius and build amazing startups:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25438
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25575,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25575,
                    "startIndex": 25574,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25574
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25751,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25751,
                    "startIndex": 25575,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "OpenAI is not going to build a cattle-herding drone, buy an old F-150 and drive from ranch to ranch like the founder of one of the fastest-growing YC W26 startups, Graze Mate.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25575
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25752,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25752,
                    "startIndex": 25751,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25751
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25840,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25840,
                    "startIndex": 25752,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Anthropic is not going to integrate with dental insurance verification systems (Lance).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25752
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25841,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25841,
                    "startIndex": 25840,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25840
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25902,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25902,
                    "startIndex": 25841,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Google is not going to navigate NATO procurement (Milliray).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25841
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 25903,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 25903,
                    "startIndex": 25902,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25902
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26277,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26277,
                    "startIndex": 25903,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The value is in the last mile, not the model. Sales cycles require humans who understand the customer. And most importantly, the market is expanding, not shrinking: AI isn't cannibalizing the existing 1% software spend — it's unlocking the other 5-6% that was going to humans. That's a much bigger market for startups yet-to-be-founded than the one the labs are playing in.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 25903
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26278,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26278,
                    "startIndex": 26277,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26277
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26305,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26305,
                    "startIndex": 26278,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Now, what DOES seem risky?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26278
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26306,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26306,
                    "startIndex": 26305,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26305
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26471,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26471,
                    "startIndex": 26306,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A thin UI layer on top of ChatGPT with no domain expertise; a general-purpose chatbot or assistant; or a product that gets obsolete when model capabilities improve.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26306
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26472,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26472,
                    "startIndex": 26471,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26471
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26745,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26745,
                    "startIndex": 26472,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But — tools for specific industries; \"full-stack\" AI companies that actually are the service (AI law firm, AI accounting firm, AI uranium exploration company); or generally products where the customer doesn't want a tool but an outcome — are defensible ideas for startups.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26472
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26746,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26746,
                    "startIndex": 26745,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26745
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26855,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26855,
                    "startIndex": 26746,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Retweeted by Paul Graham. This is the fear since day one. They won't do everything but they will do a lot.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26746
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26856,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26856,
                    "startIndex": 26855,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26855
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26858,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26858,
                    "startIndex": 26856,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26856
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26859,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26859,
                    "startIndex": 26858,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26858
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26870,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26870,
                    "startIndex": 26859,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Kobeissi -\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26859
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26871,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26871,
                    "startIndex": 26870,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26870
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26909,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26909,
                    "startIndex": 26871,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The US software sector is struggling:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26871
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 26910,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 26910,
                    "startIndex": 26909,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26909
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27007,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27007,
                    "startIndex": 26910,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Average software company loan prices are down to ~88 cents, near the lowest in at least 2 years.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 26910
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27008,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27008,
                    "startIndex": 27007,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27007
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27073,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27073,
                    "startIndex": 27008,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This marks a 6-cent, or -7% decline since the start of the year.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27008
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27074,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27074,
                    "startIndex": 27073,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27073
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27157,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27157,
                    "startIndex": 27074,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "As a result, software is the most affected sector in the US leveraged loan market.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27074
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27158,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27158,
                    "startIndex": 27157,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27157
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27357,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27357,
                    "startIndex": 27158,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Software engineering loans have dropped by -16.3 cents on average since January 20th, followed by horizontal software at -8.8 cents, cybersecurity at -5.3 cents, and vertical software at -4.2 cents.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27158
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27358,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27358,
                    "startIndex": 27357,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
