              "startIndex": 33460
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33640,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33640,
                    "startIndex": 33461,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "UAE has some of the highest solar irradiance anywhere on Earth, it is an inhospitable desert. Averaging 9.7 hours of sunlight per day with average irradiance above 2,200 kWh/m^2.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33461
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33641,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33641,
                    "startIndex": 33640,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33640
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33758,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33758,
                    "startIndex": 33641,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If you build this somewhere else, you need more solar panels because your irradiance will almost certainly be lower.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33641
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33759,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33759,
                    "startIndex": 33758,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33758
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33852,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33852,
                    "startIndex": 33759,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Even if the world had an infinite supply of free solar panels, solar power will not be free.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33759
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33853,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33853,
                    "startIndex": 33852,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33852
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34018,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34018,
                    "startIndex": 33853,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Anyone who has ever done major capital projects, who looks at where data centers need to be in the next 5 years and the next 10 years… we know it aint solar. Sorry.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33853
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34019,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34019,
                    "startIndex": 34018,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34018
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34192,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34192,
                    "startIndex": 34019,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "You struggle to even build a train track that’s 100 miles long and 10ft wide anywhere in the West, there is zero chance of build 100 square mile solar farms for GW compute.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34019
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34193,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34193,
                    "startIndex": 34192,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34192
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34308,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34308,
                    "startIndex": 34193,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is why people are talking about space compute. Deploying into space is one strategy to solve the constraints.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34193
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34309,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34309,
                    "startIndex": 34308,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34308
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34418,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34418,
                    "startIndex": 34309,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But there are faster and more scalable strategies, that get you to mass deployment of multi GW data centers.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34309
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34419,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34419,
                    "startIndex": 34418,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34418
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34574,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34574,
                    "startIndex": 34419,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "There are strategies that also allow you to power the 10 billion robots and their newtonian actuators, that immediately follow the inference demand cycle.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34419
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34575,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34575,
                    "startIndex": 34574,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34574
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34718,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34718,
                    "startIndex": 34575,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Step back and look at the full cycle of this industrial revolution… There will be billions of chips, but there will be trillions of actuators.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34575
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34719,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34719,
                    "startIndex": 34718,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34718
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34856,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34856,
                    "startIndex": 34719,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This biggest part of this revolution is the embodiment cycle, and it’s big by a factor of 20 or 50x over the stuff that comes before it.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34719
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34857,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34857,
                    "startIndex": 34856,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34856
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34980,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34980,
                    "startIndex": 34857,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "There is no analogy in human history for the scale of this economy, of the demand it will place on energy and commodities.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34857
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34981,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34981,
                    "startIndex": 34980,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34980
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 35115,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 35115,
                    "startIndex": 34981,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The humans own the Earth, and if you exist inside their legal system, they won’t let you turn the surface of their planet into glass.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34981
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 35116,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 35116,
                    "startIndex": 35115,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 35115
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 35254,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 35254,
                    "startIndex": 35116,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But they do want your chips and your actuators to serve their needs and desires. There is a way to do all of this, and so it will happen.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 35116
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 35255,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 35255,
