            },
            {
              "endIndex": 463,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 39,
                    "startIndex": 27,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Ok, I think ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 203,
                    "startIndex": 39,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "my experiment leaving AI working on stuff 24/7 ends here. It doesn't work. Code explodes in complexity, results are not that great, the AI can't get past hard walls",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 463,
                    "startIndex": 203,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " (it is still completely unable to even *grasp* SupGen), and it is insanely expensive (spent ~1k over the last 2 days). The best results are on the JS compiler, mostly because it is familiar (compared to inets), but not worth losing control over the codebase.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 464,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 464,
                    "startIndex": 463,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 463
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 784,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 611,
                    "startIndex": 464,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I think the dream of having AI's working on the background and making real progress on things that matter (i.e., truly new things) isn't here yet. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 784,
                    "startIndex": 611,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It is still a machine hard-stuck on its own training data, incapable of thinking out of the box. It is great for building things that were already built. But not new things\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 464
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 785,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 785,
                    "startIndex": 784,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 784
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 997,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 997,
                    "startIndex": 785,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Also coding normally has the under-appreciated advantage that you're doing two things at the same time: building a codebase *and* learning it. AI's do only half of that. The other half is obviously impossible 🤔\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
