              "endIndex": 31262,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 31262,
                    "startIndex": 31084,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The paper stresses humility given past prediction failures (offshoring, robots, China shock) and positions this as a periodically updatable baseline before large effects appear.\n",
