                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 31856,
                    "startIndex": 31704,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". The Washington Post first reported this development, which puts one of America’s chief nuclear-armed competitors in this rapidly expanding conflict. \n",
