                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33699
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33717,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33717,
                    "startIndex": 33700,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Some cunt on X -\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33700
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33718,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33718,
                    "startIndex": 33717,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33717
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33816,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33816,
                    "startIndex": 33718,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "One man mass-predicted the future of technology for 35 years and nobody repriced their worldview.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33718
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 33817,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 33817,
                    "startIndex": 33816,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33816
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34006,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34006,
                    "startIndex": 33817,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In 1999, Kurzweil said AGI by 2029. Stanford organized a conference to discuss it. They polled several hundred AI experts. 80% said it would take 100 years. Geoffrey Hinton was among them.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 33817
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34007,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34007,
                    "startIndex": 34006,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34006
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34067,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34067,
                    "startIndex": 34007,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Kurzweil was the only person in the room who said 30 years.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34007
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34068,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34068,
                    "startIndex": 34067,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34067
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34269,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34269,
                    "startIndex": 34068,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "By 2024, Hinton publicly said he was wrong. Metaculus prediction markets moved from 2060 to 2036 to roughly 2028. Sam Altman, Dario Amodei, and Jensen Huang all converged on 2028-2029. Elon said 2026.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34068
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34270,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34270,
                    "startIndex": 34269,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34269
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34348,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34348,
                    "startIndex": 34270,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The consensus moved 70 years closer to Kurzweil. Kurzweil didn’t move at all.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34270
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34349,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34349,
                    "startIndex": 34348,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34348
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34645,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34645,
                    "startIndex": 34349,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What separates his method from the experts who kept updating: he never predicted AI breakthroughs. He predicted compute trajectories. His 1999 model tracked the exponential growth in calculations per constant dollar since 1939. A 75 quadrillion-fold increase. He just followed the curve forward.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34349
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34646,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34646,
                    "startIndex": 34645,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34645
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34838,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34838,
                    "startIndex": 34646,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The experts at that Stanford conference were reasoning from the state of the art. Kurzweil was reasoning from the rate of change. That’s why they had to update every 5 years and he never did.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34646
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 34839,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34839,
                    "startIndex": 34838,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34838
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 35046,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 35046,
                    "startIndex": 34839,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "86% accuracy across 147 predictions. 35 years of receipts. And the next prediction on his list is the one people still laugh off: singularity by 2045, where machine intelligence merges with human cognition.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 34839
            },
