              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 44076,
                    "startIndex": 43793,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Every VC is understandably scared of making investments that will get crushed by the model companies. So they’re searching for things that feel protected. I wonder if that’s the right approach. Focusing on downside protection has generally been a terrible way to invest in startups.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
