                }
              },
              "startIndex": 50976
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51049,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51049,
                    "startIndex": 50977,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Jensen brings in the Groq acquisition related to higher priced tokens. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 50977
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51050,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51050,
                    "startIndex": 51049,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51049
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51202,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51202,
                    "startIndex": 51050,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Says the economics of generating tokens is not a race to the bottom. He argues it’s a race to the top, the smartest models users will pay the most for.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51050
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51203,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51203,
                    "startIndex": 51202,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51202
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51260,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51260,
                    "startIndex": 51203,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Token pricing will be increasingly segmented into tiers.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51203
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51261,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51261,
                    "startIndex": 51260,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51260
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51328,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51328,
                    "startIndex": 51261,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Tier 1: High throughput and low latency (often free or low-cost). \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51261
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51329,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51329,
                    "startIndex": 51328,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51328
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51373,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51373,
                    "startIndex": 51329,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Tier 2: Larger models, specialized pricing.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51329
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51374,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51374,
                    "startIndex": 51373,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51373
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51564,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51564,
                    "startIndex": 51374,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Tier \"N\": The largest, smartest models. The more input token context, the smarter the models, the price goes up. This will be Nvidia's most advanced GPU ,Groq 3 into the Vera Rubin platform\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51374
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51565,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51565,
                    "startIndex": 51564,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51564
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51777,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51574,
                    "startIndex": 51565,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "My take: ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51666,
                    "startIndex": 51574,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Makes sense. Not all AI is created equal, and premium tokens will in part be powered by Groq",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.91764706,
                              "green": 0.9137255,
                              "red": 0.90588236
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51777,
                    "startIndex": 51666,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". Application providers will pay for different tiers depending on the task. Groq should be 25% of data center.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51565
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 51778,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 51778,
                    "startIndex": 51777,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51777
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 52681,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 52681,
                    "startIndex": 51778,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ I’m less sure. Are models getting smarter with size or are they getting better at training for the tests? If it is not a size issue, then an adequate model on a phone will keep costs low. Will people compete for smarter and faster tokens? Can you really get smarter tokens or does it saturate around the level of the user’s collective appreciation of the output (and the trainer’s)? How much information work needs IQ 150+? Will we need blink thinking/CoT to increase ‘intelligence’ (rapid next token prediction to think pages in a millisecond)? One thing that does seem sure: information work will move towards models essentially talking to each other, just as human work is all corporate intalk and crosstalk. The difference is that human information work is about aggregating expertise and holding knowledge. But why call in Deloitte when you can do that work yourself? What becomes of specialism?\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 51778
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 52682,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 52682,
                    "startIndex": 52681,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
