                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55136
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55178,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55178,
                    "startIndex": 55137,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If Iran wins, it's the end of five eras.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55137
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55179,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55179,
                    "startIndex": 55178,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55178
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55207,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55207,
                    "startIndex": 55179,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1991-2026: the unipolar era\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55179
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55238,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55238,
                    "startIndex": 55207,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1974-2026: the petrodollar era\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55207
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55265,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55265,
                    "startIndex": 55238,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1945-2026: the postwar era\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55238
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55290,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55290,
                    "startIndex": 55265,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1776-2026: the union era\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55265
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55317,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55317,
                    "startIndex": 55290,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1492-2026: the Western era\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55290
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55318,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55318,
                    "startIndex": 55317,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55317
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55683,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55683,
                    "startIndex": 55318,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Specifically, the end of the petrodollar (1974) would also be the end of the unipolar moment (1991) and the postwar order (1945). It would mark the moment when Eurasian powers were once again dominant over Western powers (1492). Finally, a rapid crash in the dollar's purchasing power coupled with military defeat could well break apart the American union (1776). \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55318
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55684,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55684,
                    "startIndex": 55683,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55683
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55841,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55841,
                    "startIndex": 55684,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Few seem to viscerally understand just how dependent America is on money printing. But the end of the petrodollar is the end of Keynesianism as we know it. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55684
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 55842,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 55842,
                    "startIndex": 55841,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 55841
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56073,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56073,
                    "startIndex": 55842,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And if there's a sudden cost-of-living spike on top of pre-existing levels of political polarization, which are already near Civil War levels...we could see the scenarios that Dalio, the Fourth Turning, and Turchin have described.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
