                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57600
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57629,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57629,
                    "startIndex": 57628,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57628
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57717,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57717,
                    "startIndex": 57629,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The cost of running an LLM is dropping, but total computing energy is exploding anyway.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57629
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57718,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57718,
                    "startIndex": 57717,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57717
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57987,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57987,
                    "startIndex": 57718,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It mathematically proves that as the unit cost of digital intelligence and coding drops, the aggregate demand for complex AI agents and the infrastructure to support them surges exponentially, creating a massive new downstream ecosystem that requires human management.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57718
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57988,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57988,
                    "startIndex": 57987,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57987
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58190,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58190,
                    "startIndex": 57988,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Reveals a massive paradox where dropping the price of AI usage does not save money, but instead encourages developers to build vastly more complex agents that eat up exponentially more computing power.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57988
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58191,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58191,
                    "startIndex": 58190,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58190
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58389,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58228,
                    "startIndex": 58191,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Because of this relentless progress, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58389,
                    "startIndex": 58228,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "small companies building simple applications on top of these models get completely crushed as the core AI naturally absorbs those exact same features over time.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "green": 1,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58191
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58390,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58390,
                    "startIndex": 58389,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58389
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58541,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58541,
                    "startIndex": 58390,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "They also discovered a brutal dynamic where a perfectly working LLM becomes economically worthless the moment a competitor releases a smarter version.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58390
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58542,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58542,
                    "startIndex": 58541,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58541
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58733,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58554,
                    "startIndex": 58542,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Ultimately, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58731,
                    "startIndex": 58554,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "the researchers prove that this combination of massive computing costs and the need for constant user data naturally pushes the entire AI industry toward an unavoidable monopoly",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "green": 1,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
