                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The \"run on inference\" isn't caused by a single failure, but by three separate physical \"walls\" hitting at once. While model capability has continued to advance (moving from simple chat to \"reasoning\" models that \"think\" before they speak), the infrastructure to serve these models is red-lining.\n",
