                    "endIndex": 74329,
                    "startIndex": 74027,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " CPO allows a data center to act as one giant \"System of Chips.\" If one rack is idle, its memory and compute can be \"loaned\" to another rack instantly with zero latency. This has improved data center utilization from 60% to over 90%, effectively \"finding\" 30% more capacity without building new chips.\n",
