            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104389,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104389,
                    "startIndex": 104376,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Luke Puplett\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104376
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104390,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104390,
                    "startIndex": 104389,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104389
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104546,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104546,
                    "startIndex": 104390,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "There's a potential adequacy ceiling. How well ironed do you need your shirt? How correct do you need a report? How plausible do you need an opinion peice?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104390
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104547,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104547,
                    "startIndex": 104546,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104546
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104724,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104724,
                    "startIndex": 104547,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Most work is done by ordinary people to an adequate standard, is of questionable value and is often just doing pointless 'important' activities that have been forced upon them.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104547
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104725,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104725,
                    "startIndex": 104724,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104724
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104885,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104885,
                    "startIndex": 104725,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "How much human activity is conspicuous productivity within an infinite status game? How much hiring is simply in service to ego, either directly or indirectly?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104725
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 104886,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 104886,
                    "startIndex": 104885,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104885
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105027,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105027,
                    "startIndex": 104886,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "There might also be an attention ceiling/saturation. Is MoltBook valuable (to us) if only GPUs look at it? Some parts, yes; large parts, no.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 104886
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105028,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105028,
                    "startIndex": 105027,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105027
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105251,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105251,
                    "startIndex": 105028,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Value is in the eye of the beholder. Value is thus a function of human consciousness. Will AI create its own intricate value system that we either can't turn off or that we sympathise with, as we do for the animal kingdom.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105028
            },
