                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105442
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105486,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105486,
                    "startIndex": 105443,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "⚡️This is the moment the model gets hands.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105443
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105487,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105487,
                    "startIndex": 105486,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105486
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105515,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105515,
                    "startIndex": 105487,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That is the real threshold.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105487
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105516,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105516,
                    "startIndex": 105515,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105515
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105802,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105802,
                    "startIndex": 105516,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Once an AI can see the screen, move the cursor, type, navigate software, and execute workflows across arbitrary apps, the whole game changes. The limiting factor stops being language quality. The limiting factor becomes agency. Can the model actually do the work, not just describe it.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105516
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 105803,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 105803,
                    "startIndex": 105802,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105802
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106262,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106079,
                    "startIndex": 105803,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That is why this matters so much. The modern office is already a robot environment. Buttons, forms, dashboards, tabs, permissions, drop-downs, inboxes, calendars, CRMs, spreadsheets, admin portals. Humans were the temporary glue holding all that fragmented software together. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106192,
                    "startIndex": 106079,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The moment an AI can operate the same interfaces, a huge amount of white collar labor becomes directly attackable",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106262,
                    "startIndex": 106192,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " without waiting for every company in the world to rebuild its stack.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 105803
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106263,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106263,
                    "startIndex": 106262,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106262
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106656,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106656,
                    "startIndex": 106263,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A lot of “knowledge work” was never pure insight. It was operational stitching. Open this. Copy that. Check this field. Schedule that meeting. Move this information between systems. Generate the draft. Update the CRM. Reconcile the report. Upload the file. Follow the workflow. Escalate the exception. Once the model can touch the interface, the human integration layer starts getting erased.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106263
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106657,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106657,
                    "startIndex": 106656,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106656
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106715,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106715,
                    "startIndex": 106657,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The desktop is becoming the first real robot body for AI.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106657
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 106716,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106716,
                    "startIndex": 106715,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106715
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107022,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106772,
                    "startIndex": 106716,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "People keep imagining humanoids as the big labor shock. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 106823,
                    "startIndex": 106772,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The real labor shock arrives sooner through screens",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107022,
                    "startIndex": 106823,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". The average office worker already lives inside a digital box. If the model can act inside that box, it has entered the worker’s physical domain. That is enough to trigger a major compression wave.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 106716
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107023,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107023,
                    "startIndex": 107022,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107022
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107386,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107251,
                    "startIndex": 107023,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The first wave will be supervised agency. One human overseeing multiple agentic processes. One operator managing ten machine clerks. One analyst managing five machine researchers. One coordinator managing twenty machine admins. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107339,
                    "startIndex": 107251,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That still destroys labor demand because the firm no longer needs one human per workflow",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107386,
                    "startIndex": 107339,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". It needs one human per cluster of workflows.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107023
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107387,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107387,
                    "startIndex": 107386,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107386
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107423,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107423,
                    "startIndex": 107387,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That is where the real cull begins.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107387
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107424,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107424,
                    "startIndex": 107423,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107423
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107842,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107622,
                    "startIndex": 107424,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The next layer is organizational. Middle management, operations teams, chiefs of staff, coordinators, assistants, junior analysts, support staff, back-office processors, internal service functions, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107702,
                    "startIndex": 107622,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "all the roles built around moving information through software become vulnerable",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107842,
                    "startIndex": 107702,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". Once the CEO, VP, or manager can directly deploy agentic systems into the stack, the argument for multiple relay layers gets weaker fast.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107424
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 107843,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107843,
                    "startIndex": 107842,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107842
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108038,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107858,
                    "startIndex": 107843,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And deep down, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 107894,
                    "startIndex": 107858,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "this is how bureaucracy starts dying",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9137255,
                              "green": 0.8235294,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108038,
                    "startIndex": 107894,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". Through hundreds of micro-automations that remove the need for human routing, human clicking, human follow-up, human translation, human glue.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 107843
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108039,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108039,
                    "startIndex": 108038,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108038
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108109,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108109,
                    "startIndex": 108039,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The deepest part is that capability is no longer the hardest problem.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108039
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108110,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108110,
                    "startIndex": 108109,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108109
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108120,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108120,
                    "startIndex": 108110,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Trust is.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108110
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108121,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108121,
                    "startIndex": 108120,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108120
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108142,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108142,
                    "startIndex": 108121,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who gets permission.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108121
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108165,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108165,
                    "startIndex": 108142,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who watches the model.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108142
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108212,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108212,
                    "startIndex": 108165,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who is liable when it clicks the wrong button.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108165
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108236,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108236,
                    "startIndex": 108212,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who audits what it did.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108212
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108266,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108266,
                    "startIndex": 108236,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who controls the credentials.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108236
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108344,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108344,
                    "startIndex": 108266,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Who stops the model from becoming a security breach with a smile on its face.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108266
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108345,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108345,
                    "startIndex": 108344,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108344
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108653,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108653,
                    "startIndex": 108345,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That is the next battlefield. The winning AI platform will not just be the one that can act. It will be the one enterprises trust enough to let act at scale. Reliability, auditability, security, permissions, rollback, human override, those become more important than one more bump in benchmark intelligence.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108345
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108654,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108654,
                    "startIndex": 108653,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108653
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108681,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108681,
                    "startIndex": 108654,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "So my real view is simple.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108654
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108682,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108682,
                    "startIndex": 108681,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108681
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108744,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108744,
                    "startIndex": 108682,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is one of the most important threshold crossings so far.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108682
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108745,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108745,
                    "startIndex": 108744,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108744
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108789,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108789,
                    "startIndex": 108745,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI is moving from cognition into execution.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108745
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108790,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108790,
                    "startIndex": 108789,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108789
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108831,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108831,
                    "startIndex": 108790,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The computer is becoming its robot body.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108790
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108832,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108832,
                    "startIndex": 108831,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108831
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108883,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108883,
                    "startIndex": 108832,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The office stack is becoming automatable in place.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108832
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108884,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108884,
                    "startIndex": 108883,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108883
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108948,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108948,
                    "startIndex": 108884,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A massive slice of white collar labor is now in the blast zone.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108884
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 108949,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 108949,
                    "startIndex": 108948,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108948
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109012,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109012,
                    "startIndex": 108949,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Once the model can operate the software, the countdown starts.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 108949
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109013,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109013,
                    "startIndex": 109012,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109012
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109445,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109445,
                    "startIndex": 109013,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Computer use has been around for a bit. Website use via mouse and keyboard is weird; HTML is an API. Nightmare for security, will take a while. Software itself is premised on automation and manual effort efficiency, and yet most software companies with even a small app have thousands of coders on staff. You have to ask why this is, when any engineer who knows their stuff would agree a small team of seven would go much faster.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109013
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109446,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109446,
                    "startIndex": 109445,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109445
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109598,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.ph115nbnj5m1",
                  "textStyle": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109598,
                    "startIndex": 109446,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The workplace is a playing field for status games. Society is an elaborate status game. Empire building is no fun without people, envy abhors a vacuum.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109446
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109661,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.ph115nbnj5m1",
                  "textStyle": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109661,
                    "startIndex": 109598,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Work is also a place for companionship and achieving together.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109598
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109690,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.ph115nbnj5m1",
                  "textStyle": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109690,
                    "startIndex": 109661,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Rule-makers gonna rule-make.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109661
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109790,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.ph115nbnj5m1",
                  "textStyle": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109790,
                    "startIndex": 109690,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Thirdly, people infect other people with more work, many infect more than 1.0 so they cause hiring.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 109690
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 109838,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.ph115nbnj5m1",
                  "textStyle": {
                    "bold": true
                  }
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 109838,
                    "startIndex": 109790,
