              "endIndex": 111610,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 111610,
                    "startIndex": 111368,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And I think that's fine. Spending your free time building things is super enjoyable, and most of the time you don't really have to care about code quality and maintainability. It also gives you a way to learn a new tech stack if you so want.\n",
