            {
              "endIndex": 120611,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 120611,
                    "startIndex": 120397,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is also why those code smell booboos happen in the first place. The agent misses existing code, duplicates things, introduces inconsistencies. And then they blossom into a beautiful shit flower of complexity.\n",
