                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126137
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 126140,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 126140,
                    "startIndex": 126139,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126139
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 126340,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 126340,
                    "startIndex": 126140,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "We need a wallet system. The first attestation of humanity must be done by a human. The first delegation attestation also starts with the human. After that, agents can delegate further to sub-agents.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126140
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 126500,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 126500,
                    "startIndex": 126340,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The first delegation could potentially skip direct human action if there's an authorized API for making delegation attestations (human pre-authorizes the API).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126340
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 126699,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 126699,
                    "startIndex": 126500,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Key question: who pays for / executes delegations? If an agent does it, it requires MCP calls. The agent must identify / authenticate itself for those calls — that's the core identification problem.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126500
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 126921,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 126921,
                    "startIndex": 126699,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "To authenticate an MCP call from a delegated agent: it presents a delegation proof (validated back to a human-issued attestation, e.g., from Zipporah proving humanity). Chicken-and-egg issue for the very first delegation.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126699
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127198,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127198,
                    "startIndex": 126921,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Solution path: assume the human must perform the initial delegation. Then build an API (and/or MCP service) allowing already-delegated wallets to make further delegations. The caller presents its delegation proof chain (validated back to human attestation). If valid, proceed.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 126921
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127339,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127339,
                    "startIndex": 127198,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But attestations require signing — the system can't sign on behalf of wallets. Agents must submit signed delegation transactions themselves.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127198
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127526,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127526,
                    "startIndex": 127339,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Injective MCP appears to be the standard way bots perform blockchain actions. Once delegation is validated on-chain (human → agent), we can issue a signed message attesting to that fact.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127339
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127695,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127695,
                    "startIndex": 127526,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Proposal: offer both an API and MCP support. Bots use MCP to interact, then receive a signed token / certificate from Zipwire proving they are a delegated agent wallet.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127526
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127774,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127774,
                    "startIndex": 127695,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Use ProofPack (compact JWS format) for this: return a one-line JWS containing:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127695
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127824,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.lfxrn3wgabxg",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127824,
                    "startIndex": 127774,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Proof they are delegated from a human root wallet\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127774
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127854,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.lfxrn3wgabxg",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127854,
                    "startIndex": 127824,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Optional: human's nationality\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127824
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 127901,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.lfxrn3wgabxg",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 127901,
                    "startIndex": 127854,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Optional: age bracket / over certain threshold\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127854
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128008,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.lfxrn3wgabxg",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128008,
                    "startIndex": 127901,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Any other selective disclosure attributes the human has attested (from trusted sources, initially just us)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 127901
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128032,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128032,
                    "startIndex": 128008,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "To build the ProofPack:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128008
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128089,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.6wktafagleip",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128089,
                    "startIndex": 128032,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Identify the root human wallet via the delegation chain.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128032
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128168,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.6wktafagleip",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128168,
                    "startIndex": 128089,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Look up attestations issued to that wallet (humanity, age, nationality, etc.).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128089
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128234,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.6wktafagleip",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128234,
                    "startIndex": 128168,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If valid, extract relevant leaves and bundle into the signed JWS.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128168
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128256,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128256,
                    "startIndex": 128234,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Verification options:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128234
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128408,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.44ob5qdllo3s",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128408,
                    "startIndex": 128256,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Third-party MCP services / backends call our Zipwire API, submit the JWS → we validate and return the extracted leaf contents (nationality, age, etc.).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128256
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128465,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.44ob5qdllo3s",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128465,
                    "startIndex": 128408,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Or clients verify directly using our JavaScript library.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spacingMode": "COLLAPSE_LISTS"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128408
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128658,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128658,
                    "startIndex": 128465,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This gives delegated agents a verifiable, compact credential they can present for authentication in MCP calls or elsewhere, solving the chicken-egg bootstrap while enabling chained delegation.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128465
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128684,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128684,
                    "startIndex": 128658,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Human (root wallet owner)\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "lineSpacing": 100,
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "spaceAbove": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "spaceBelow": {
                    "magnitude": 12,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  }
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 128658
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 128796,
              "paragraph": {
                "bullet": {
                  "listId": "kix.245pkow6jki5",
                  "textStyle": {}
                },
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 128796,
                    "startIndex": 128684,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Self-attest humanity via Zipwire \"IsAHuman\" attestation (initial Proof of Personhood on-chain, e.g., Base/EAS).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "indentFirstLine": {
                    "magnitude": 18,
                    "unit": "PT"
                  },
                  "indentStart": {
                    "magnitude": 36,
