              "startIndex": 131532
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 131884,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 131884,
                    "startIndex": 131634,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This covers the bootstrap (human-first), chaining, authentication bootstrap via ProofPack, and agentic execution on MCP chains like Injective. Prioritize revocation + payment abstraction next—they block safe scaling. Let me know which to drill into.\n",
