              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 446,
                    "startIndex": 409,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Key drivers of the downturn include:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 409
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 447,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 447,
                    "startIndex": 446,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 446
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 549,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 549,
                    "startIndex": 447,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A \"risk-off\" wave across global markets, with unwinding of crowded trades (including in gold/silver).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 447
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 823,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 823,
                    "startIndex": 549,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Uncertainty over U.S. interest-rate policy following President Trump's nomination of Kevin Warsh as the next Federal Reserve chair (dubbed the \"Warsh shock\" in some coverage), raising concerns about prolonged higher rates or shifts that could hurt growth-sensitive sectors.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 549
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 1067,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 1067,
                    "startIndex": 823,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Doubts about the sustainability of AI-driven spending and demand, hitting South Korea's tech-heavy market hard. Major chipmakers like Samsung Electronics and SK Hynix (key drivers of the KOSPI's prior strong rally) each fell over 6% at points.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 823
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 1193,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 1193,
                    "startIndex": 1067,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Broader Asian market weakness, with tech routs spreading (e.g., influences from Wall Street AI jitters and mixed China data).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
