                    "endIndex": 1716,
                    "startIndex": 1474,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Sure enough, my wife had used ChatGPT's answer sheet to grade his work, and ChatGPT spit out many incorrect answers.  Turns out 6 of the 8 it marked as incorrect were actually correct.  Now I have to review the other 18 to see what happened.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
