              "endIndex": 3363,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3363,
                    "startIndex": 3341,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "**By Kenneth Hughes**\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3341
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3364,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3364,
                    "startIndex": 3363,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3363
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3560,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3560,
                    "startIndex": 3364,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "(Bloomberg) -- OpenAI is unsatisfied with some of Nvidia’s latest AI chips and has sought alternatives since last year, Reuters reports, citing eight unidentified people familiar with the matter.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3364
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3561,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3561,
                    "startIndex": 3560,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3560
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3701,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3701,
                    "startIndex": 3561,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* OpenAI needs new hardware that would eventually provide about 10% of its inference computing needs in the future, one person told Reuters\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3561
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3825,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3825,
                    "startIndex": 3701,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* OpenAI has discussed working with startups including Cerebras and Groq to provide chips for faster inference, report says\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3701
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3987,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3987,
                    "startIndex": 3825,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* OpenAI’s shifting product road map also has changed the kind of computational resources it requires and bogged down talks with Nvidia, one person familiar said\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3825
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3988,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3988,
                    "startIndex": 3987,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3987
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 3989,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 3989,
                    "startIndex": 3988,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3988
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4040,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4040,
                    "startIndex": 3989,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* Cerebras and Groq declined to comment to Reuters\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 3989
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4210,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4210,
                    "startIndex": 4040,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* “Customers continue to choose NVIDIA for inference because we deliver the best performance and total cost of ownership at scale,” Nvidia said in a statement to Reuters\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4040
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4427,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4427,
                    "startIndex": 4210,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "* A spokesperson for OpenAI in a separate statement told Reuters “the company relies on Nvidia to power the vast majority of its inference fleet and that Nvidia delivers the best performance per dollar for inference”\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
