                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4567,
                    "startIndex": 4527,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "$META CEO [Zuck] on call post earnings:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4527
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4568,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4568,
                    "startIndex": 4567,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4567
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4936,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4936,
                    "startIndex": 4568,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"I should say on the broader point about the impact of AI on our hiring plans, we expect that there are going to be big improvements in productivity across our workforce over the next few years. But depending on how those improvements play out, we may want to add more people if, for example, each engineer can deliver greater impacts than they would have previously.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4568
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 4937,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 4937,
                    "startIndex": 4936,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4936
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 5320,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 5320,
                    "startIndex": 4937,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "So, we don’t know exactly how this will net out, but we’re very focused on making sure that we lean into the productivity tools that exist, make them widely available, make sure that we are able to identify folks who are using them really well, and make sure that our organization structure is evolving over time to meet the needs of how people work in a new AI-enhanced landscape.”\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 4937
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 5321,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
