              "endIndex": 6895,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 6895,
                    "startIndex": 6724,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Michael Barton (@lordbartonjr), Sector Head at Coatue (@coatuemgmt) on how the hedge fund is thinking about AI, agents, & how it'll impact future trading workflows + jobs\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 6724
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 6896,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 6896,
                    "startIndex": 6895,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 6895
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7045,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7045,
                    "startIndex": 6896,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"I think that today, 85% of what I do basically can be done by AI. And it’s not a question of is the tech ready. It’s how do we implement the tech.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 6896
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7046,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7046,
                    "startIndex": 7045,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7045
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7052,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7052,
                    "startIndex": 7046,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". . .\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7046
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7460,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7460,
                    "startIndex": 7052,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"Thinking about how this tech will transform Coatue — that gets accelerated massively in the AI world. My belief, and something that I spend a lot of my time on, is how do we use AI internally and how do we build a workforce and reimagine the workflows, especially in a space where, as you know, most financial services companies — whether it’s a hedge fund or a bank — are like the last guys to adopt tech.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7052
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7461,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7461,
                    "startIndex": 7460,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7460
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7584,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7584,
                    "startIndex": 7461,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And so we think there’s this huge moment where we’re able to create the investment fund of the future. It’s happening now.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7461
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7585,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7585,
                    "startIndex": 7584,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7584
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7789,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7789,
                    "startIndex": 7585,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "My view is — I tell my friends this and they laugh — but I think that today, 85% of what I do basically can be done by AI. And it’s not a question of is the tech ready. It’s how do we implement the tech.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7585
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 7790,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 7790,
                    "startIndex": 7789,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7789
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8149,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8149,
                    "startIndex": 7790,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "So we’re hiring a class of analysts to come in and help me with this problem, and basically figure out how to reimagine the workflows that we do every day — from coming in in the morning, checking my email, seeing all of the different sell-side notes. I spend two hours doing that because you have to read everything, but there are only a few important ones.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 7790
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8150,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8150,
                    "startIndex": 8149,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8149
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8357,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8357,
                    "startIndex": 8150,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "How do I build a model with a click of a button? How do I take disparate datasets and bring them together? How do we do every single step of the investment process — how can we use AI to almost automate it?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8150
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8358,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8358,
                    "startIndex": 8357,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8357
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8498,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8498,
                    "startIndex": 8358,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And if you can do that, those six new analysts we hire, in three years, are basically sector heads with 25 agents working around the clock.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 8358
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 8499,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 8499,
                    "startIndex": 8498,
                    "textRun": {
