              "endIndex": 13446,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13444,
                    "startIndex": 13316,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "the AI enabled productivity accelerate will result in much much much more demand for traditionally understood software, not less",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.91764706,
                              "green": 0.9137255,
                              "red": 0.90588236
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13446,
                    "startIndex": 13444,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13316
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 13447,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13447,
                    "startIndex": 13446,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13446
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 13558,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13558,
                    "startIndex": 13447,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The world is massively under-softwared and AI will allow more processes, actions and services to be distilled.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13447
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 13559,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13559,
                    "startIndex": 13558,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13558
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 13903,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13903,
                    "startIndex": 13559,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "(An easy way to think about this, all of your AI agents running around will need to save back to some sort of system of record--you will end up with more databases, more datastores, more demand to read-out distillations of that data, more custom transformations, this will distill all the way down for more demand for traditional CPU compute.)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13559
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 13904,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 13904,
                    "startIndex": 13903,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13903
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 14624,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 14624,
                    "startIndex": 13904,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "and the current #saaspocolypse will drive more incremental growth towards AI at the expense of traditional SaaS. The SaaS companies themselves will heavily pull back on any hiring, instructing line-leaders to more heavily use AI to deliver rather than adding heads--so they themselves will become more AI consumptive. And the marginal company making a decision between 3rd party SaaS vs DIY or engage someone like Palantir with engineering-led sales to help you DIY, will not be able to get the same guarantees of service or time/attention/energy as they otherwise would have going the SaaS route as those companies pull in horns (and as the market reward for incremental ARR remains depressed.)\u000b\u000b^ Grok, short version:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 13904
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 14625,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 14625,
                    "startIndex": 14624,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 14624
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 14770,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 14770,
                    "startIndex": 14625,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI doesn't replace software. It makes way more shit need software (agents saving data → boom in databases, transformations, old-school compute).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 14625
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 14771,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 14771,
                    "startIndex": 14770,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 14770
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 15021,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 15021,
                    "startIndex": 14771,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "SaaS is hurting right now → companies cut hiring, lean on AI internally, and stop being as good at selling/supporting their product. So more people say \"fuck it, we'll build/customize with AI instead\" → traditional SaaS loses ground, AI eats faster.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 14771
            },
