              "endIndex": 22382,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 22382,
                    "startIndex": 22135,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It is only possible to travel to Mars when the planets align every 26 months (six month trip time), whereas we can launch to the Moon every 10 days (2 day trip time). This means we can iterate much faster to complete a Moon city than a Mars city.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
