            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27099,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27099,
                    "startIndex": 27030,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "There are three strong tailwinds to growth over the coming quarters:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27030
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27100,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27100,
                    "startIndex": 27099,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27099
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27174,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27174,
                    "startIndex": 27100,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1. Many financings for data centers have already been committed for 2026.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27100
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27175,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27175,
                    "startIndex": 27174,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27174
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27301,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27301,
                    "startIndex": 27175,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "2. There is strong political support for bringing back production facilities for semiconductors, pharmaceuticals and defense.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27175
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27302,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27302,
                    "startIndex": 27301,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27301
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27419,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27419,
                    "startIndex": 27302,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "3. Fiscal policy is expansionary and will, according to the CBO, lift GDP growth this year by 0.9 percentage points.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27302
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27420,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27420,
                    "startIndex": 27419,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27419
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27644,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27644,
                    "startIndex": 27420,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The bottom line is that it is very difficult to be bearish on the US economic outlook, and later this year the conversation in markets will change from talking about Fed cuts to instead talking about the Fed having to hike.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27420
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27645,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27645,
                    "startIndex": 27644,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27644
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 27801,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 27801,
                    "startIndex": 27645,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If the Fed is unwilling to hike in response to an overheating economy, it would increase the risk of higher long rates, a steeper curve and a lower dollar.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 27645
            },
