              "startIndex": 67574
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 67886,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 67886,
                    "startIndex": 67575,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The speaker isn't just worried about their own bank account—they are worried about a global financial domino effect. * The Shell Game: OpenAI isn't necessarily walking into a bank to borrow $\\$100$ billion. Instead, they are signing \"IOUs\" (long-term contracts) to partners like Microsoft, Oracle, or SoftBank.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 67575
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 67887,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 67887,
                    "startIndex": 67886,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 67886
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 68060,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 68060,
                    "startIndex": 67887,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Proxy Borrower: Those partners then go to the banks and say, \"Look, OpenAI promised to pay us $\\$1$ trillion over five years. Give us a loan to build the data centers.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 67887
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 68061,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 68061,
                    "startIndex": 68060,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 68060
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 68538,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 68538,
                    "startIndex": 68061,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Trap: If OpenAI’s revenue hits $\\$800$ billion instead of $\\$1$ trillion, they can't pay their \"rent.\" Because the partners used that rent as collateral for their massive loans, everyone goes bankrupt at once. > The \"Twist\" is that the debt is a ticking time bomb hidden on someone else's balance sheet. If the growth rate dips from \"miraculous\" to merely \"incredible,\" the entire AI infrastructure collapses because it was built on a pinky-promise of exponential returns.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
