                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 72808,
                    "startIndex": 72620,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "“Palantir is not – and frankly never has been – a company that can be trusted with this nationally important contract with our NHS” says Good Law Project’s Executive Director, Jo Maugham.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
