              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 73084,
                    "startIndex": 72864,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "“Within weeks, it commissioned a covert smear campaign against a prominent critic and appears to have broken the terms of that contract. If this Government won’t act to protect the national interest, the next one must.”\n",
