            {
              "endIndex": 76708,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 75653,
                    "startIndex": 75570,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In an escalation of the friction between Silicon Valley and the Department of War, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 75856,
                    "startIndex": 75653,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth is reportedly nearing a decision to designate Anthropic as a \"supply chain risk,\" a move that would effectively blacklist the AI firm from the entire U.S. defense ecosystem",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 75878,
                    "startIndex": 75856,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". The rift centers on ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 76050,
                    "startIndex": 75878,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Anthropic’s refusal to lift safety guardrails for its Claude models, specifically prohibiting their use in fully autonomous weapons targeting and mass domestic surveillance",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 76169,
                    "startIndex": 76050,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "—restrictions Hegseth has criticized as ideological constraints that hinder \"decision superiority\" on the battlefield. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 76396,
                    "startIndex": 76169,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This move follows reports that Claude was utilized through a Palantir integration during the February 2026 raid to capture Nicolás Maduro in Venezuela, an operation that reportedly sparked internal ethical concerns at Anthropic",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
