                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115218
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115311,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115311,
                    "startIndex": 115219,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Here are the **key claims and ideas** from Sam Kriss's essay \"Child’s Play\" (very concise):\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115219
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115312,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115312,
                    "startIndex": 115311,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115311
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115531,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115531,
                    "startIndex": 115312,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- **San Francisco’s public space** is dominated by bizarre, startup-centric B2B advertising that feels alien and disconnected from the visible human misery (homelessness, drug use, mental disconnection) on the streets.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115312
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115532,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115532,
                    "startIndex": 115531,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115531
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115815,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115815,
                    "startIndex": 115532,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- **Cluely** (and founder Roy Lee) became the most hated startup in tech despite offering a fairly ordinary AI cheating/assistance tool (real-time ChatGPT/Claude overlay for Zoom calls, interviews, dates, etc.), because it openly embraces cheating and renders human effort obsolete.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115532
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 115816,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 115816,
                    "startIndex": 115815,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115815
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116037,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116037,
                    "startIndex": 115816,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- **Hypocrisy in tech criticism** — people already use AI to fake work (e.g., copying from ChatGPT), yet Cluely is uniquely despised for admitting it; past absurd investments (Juicero) show similar hype-driven absurdity.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 115816
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116038,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116038,
                    "startIndex": 116037,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116037
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116262,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116262,
                    "startIndex": 116038,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- **Core future vision in Silicon Valley** — AI will cause massive **bifurcation**: a tiny overclass becomes ultra-rich/powerful; most people become economically and intellectually **useless** (“meat for the coltan mines”).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116038
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116263,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116263,
                    "startIndex": 116262,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116262
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116414,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116414,
                    "startIndex": 116263,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- Traditional merits (intelligence, creativity, expertise, hard work) will soon be worthless once AI surpasses humans in reasoning/reflection/insight.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116263
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116415,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116415,
                    "startIndex": 116414,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116414
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116641,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116641,
                    "startIndex": 116415,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- The only irreplaceable human advantage left is **agency** (“highly agentic”): extreme willingness to act, bulldoze obstacles, ignore permission/consensus, and just **do things**; this trait now trumps skill or intelligence.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116415
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 116642,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 116642,
                    "startIndex": 116641,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116641
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117028,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117028,
                    "startIndex": 116642,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- **Roy Lee** embodies the new “agentic” archetype: zero social anxiety, extreme extroversion toward men/business, zero tolerance for being told what to do, childhood obsession with starting companies, cheats/removes friction wherever possible, minimal patience for difficulty/adversity, lives in a frat-like office with protein shakes, Labubu dolls, anime figures, and pink vibrators.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 116642
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117029,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117029,
                    "startIndex": 117028,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117028
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117244,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117244,
                    "startIndex": 117029,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- His product **Cluely** paradoxically promises total **leverage** and **never thinking alone** while turning users into passive executors of AI instructions — the exact opposite of the agency he personally prizes.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117029
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117245,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117245,
                    "startIndex": 117244,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117244
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117409,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117409,
                    "startIndex": 117245,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- The essay’s central irony: Roy violently rejects external control yet builds a tool whose entire value is **telling people exactly what to say/do** in real time.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117245
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117410,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117410,
                    "startIndex": 117409,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117409
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117656,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117656,
                    "startIndex": 117410,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- Broader dystopian implication — the AI era rewards a specific psychosexual/ personality profile (agentic, domineering, friction-averse young men) while consigning reflective, thoughtful, or “mimetic” people to irrelevance or underclass status.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117410
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117657,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117657,
                    "startIndex": 117656,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117656
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 117812,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 117812,
                    "startIndex": 117657,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The piece is a satirical/cynical portrait of how AI + startup culture is accelerating inequality and replacing thinking with automated agency + obedience.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 117657
            },
