                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 171008,
                    "startIndex": 170869,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". Past disruptions include a 2008 fire and 2024 Hurricane Helene flooding (over 24 inches of rain), which stopped operations at key sites.\n",
