                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ", provides granulated quartz from Quartz Vein No. 175 with low boron and phosphorus, suitable for photovoltaics and semiconductors. It has been used for over 50 years to make quartz tubes and crucibles, with low copper, nickel, and chromium.\n",
