                  {
                    "endIndex": 176922,
                    "startIndex": 176639,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "High-purity silica and ultra-pure quartz remain essential for semiconductors, solar, and fiber optics due to limited geological sources, complex refining, and irreplaceable properties in high-tech manufacturing. Supply chain diversification continues through policy and new sources.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
