                  {
                    "endIndex": 177244,
                    "startIndex": 176983,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Revenue up 5.7% to €2,225 million, EBITDA up 13.8% to €471 million (with a margin improvement to 21.2% from 19.7% in 2023). This marks the fourth straight year of solid gains, with EBITDA growing at a >23% CAGR from 2020–2024 under their Sibelco 2025 strategy.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
