                  {
                    "endIndex": 177447,
                    "startIndex": 177263,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Depressed European markets (especially construction-related), a sharp downturn in the global solar PV market hitting their high-purity quartz (HPQ) business in the US starting mid-2024",
