            {
              "endIndex": 181268,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181268,
                    "startIndex": 181230,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "THE DOOM LOOP ASSUMES DEMAND IS FIXED\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181230
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181269,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181269,
                    "startIndex": 181268,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181268
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181526,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181526,
                    "startIndex": 181269,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The bearish loop creates a simplified linear model: AI gets better, businesses reduce headcount and wages, then buying drops, businesses invest in AI again to defend their margins, and the downward cycle repeats. This assumes a completely stagnant economy.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181269
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181527,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181527,
                    "startIndex": 181526,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181526
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181811,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181555,
                    "startIndex": 181527,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "History suggests otherwise. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181639,
                    "startIndex": 181555,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "When the cost of producing something collapses, demand rarely stays flat, it expands",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181811,
                    "startIndex": 181639,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". When compute costs fell, we did not consume the same amount of compute more cheaply. We consumed orders of magnitude more of it and built entirely new industries on top.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181527
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181812,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181812,
                    "startIndex": 181811,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181811
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181952,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181952,
                    "startIndex": 181812,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ This has been true. My primary sense is that we’re going to need people using AI to cope with all the work people using AI will generate.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181812
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 181953,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 181953,
                    "startIndex": 181952,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181952
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182054,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182054,
                    "startIndex": 181953,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "As shown below, the price of personal computers are now 99.9% cheaper today than they were in 1980. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 181953
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182055,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182055,
                    "startIndex": 182054,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182054
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182077,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182077,
                    "startIndex": 182055,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "PC Prices - 1980-2015\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182055
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182078,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182078,
                    "startIndex": 182077,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182077
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182201,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182201,
                    "startIndex": 182078,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI decreases costs in every sector and when service costs go down, purchasing power increases with or without wage growth.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182078
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182202,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182202,
                    "startIndex": 182201,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182201
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182433,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182433,
                    "startIndex": 182202,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The doom loop becomes dominant only if AI replaces labor without materially expanding demand. The optimistic scenario emerges if cheaper compute and productivity yields entirely new categories of consumption and economic activity.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182202
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182434,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182434,
                    "startIndex": 182433,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182433
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182480,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182480,
                    "startIndex": 182434,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "THE REAL SHOCK IS PRICE COLLAPSE, NOT LAYOFFS\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182434
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182481,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182481,
                    "startIndex": 182480,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182480
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182820,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182820,
                    "startIndex": 182481,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The observable layoffs are an easier story for investors to sell, but services undergoing price compression is the bigger story. Work that involves knowledge has always been expensive because of the scarcity of knowledge, as simple as it sounds, it's true. An abundant knowledge supply leads to a reduction in the price of knowledge work.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182481
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182821,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182821,
                    "startIndex": 182820,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182820
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182928,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182928,
                    "startIndex": 182821,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Yes, but potentially lots more utilization of knowledge work. That is the paradox they described before.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182821
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 182929,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 182929,
                    "startIndex": 182928,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182928
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183247,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183247,
                    "startIndex": 182929,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Consider healthcare administration, legal documentation, tax preparation, compliance, marketing production, basic coding, customer service, and educational tutoring. These services consume massive economic resources largely because they require trained human attention. AI reduces the marginal cost of that attention.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 182929
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183248,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183248,
                    "startIndex": 183247,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183247
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183332,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183332,
                    "startIndex": 183248,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In fact, as shown below, the US Services Sector contributes close to 80% of US GDP.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183248
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183333,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183333,
                    "startIndex": 183332,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183332
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183554,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183554,
                    "startIndex": 183333,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If the cost of running a business falls, small businesses become more attainable and if the cost of accessing services falls, more households participate. In a way, AI advancements can function as an \"invisible\" tax cut.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183333
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183555,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183555,
                    "startIndex": 183554,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183554
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183727,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183559,
                    "startIndex": 183555,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183725,
                    "startIndex": 183559,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "companies whose margins depend on high-cost cognitive labor may suffer, but the broader economy benefits from lower service inflation and higher real purchasing power",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183727,
                    "startIndex": 183725,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183555
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183728,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183728,
                    "startIndex": 183727,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183727
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183764,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183764,
                    "startIndex": 183728,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "FROM “GHOST GDP” TO “ABUNDANCE GDP”\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183728
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183765,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183765,
                    "startIndex": 183764,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183764
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183998,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183998,
                    "startIndex": 183765,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The bear case relies on \"Ghost GDP,\" which is output that shows up in data but does not benefit households. The optimistic counter is what we are calling “Abundance GDP,\" which is output growth combined with falling costs of living.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183765
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 183999,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 183999,
                    "startIndex": 183998,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183998
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184105,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184105,
                    "startIndex": 183999,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ The basics never really fall. Housing, clothes, food, despite huge strides in technology of production.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 183999
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184106,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184106,
                    "startIndex": 184105,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184105
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184441,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184441,
                    "startIndex": 184106,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Abundance GDP does not require nominal incomes to surge, it requires prices to fall faster than incomes. If AI reduces the cost of services which are essential to many, households experience real gains even if their wage growth slows. As a result, productivity gains do not disappear, rather they are transmitted through lower prices.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184106
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184442,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184442,
                    "startIndex": 184441,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184441
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184529,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184529,
                    "startIndex": 184442,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Perhaps this is why productivity has outperformed wage growth over the last 70+ years:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184442
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184530,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184530,
                    "startIndex": 184529,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184529
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184776,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184776,
                    "startIndex": 184530,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The internet, electricity, mass manufacturing, and antibiotics each provided new ways to expand output and reduce cost which still being disruptive and volatile. However, in retrospect, those changes increased the standard of living permanently.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184530
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184777,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184777,
                    "startIndex": 184776,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184776
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184893,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184893,
                    "startIndex": 184777,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A society that wastes fewer hours navigating systems and paying for redundant services is, functionally, wealthier.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184777
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184894,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184894,
                    "startIndex": 184893,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184893
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184932,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184932,
                    "startIndex": 184894,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "LABOR MARKETS RESTRUCTURE, NOT VANISH\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184894
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 184933,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 184933,
                    "startIndex": 184932,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184932
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185167,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185167,
                    "startIndex": 184933,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A key concern is that AI disproportionately affects white-collar employment, which drives discretionary consumption and housing demand. This is true, and a legitimate concern, particularly as the wealth divide is already so massive. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 184933
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185168,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185168,
                    "startIndex": 185167,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185167
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185423,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185423,
                    "startIndex": 185168,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Cheap white collar underclasses such as Indians and generalist call-center stuff is not mentioned. The pattern in the west is for jobs for the entitled boys and Indians doing the work. This is real and has sustained for hundreds of years of innovation.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185168
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185424,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185424,
                    "startIndex": 185423,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185423
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185690,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185690,
                    "startIndex": 185424,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "However, AI struggles more with physical-world dexterity and human identity. Skilled trades, hands-on healthcare, advanced manufacturing, and experience-driven industries retain structural demand. In many cases, AI complements these roles rather than replaces them.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185424
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185691,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185691,
                    "startIndex": 185690,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185690
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185918,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185882,
                    "startIndex": 185691,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "More importantly, AI lowers the barrier to entrepreneurship. When one individual can automate accounting, marketing, support, and coding tasks, small-scale business formation becomes easier. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185916,
                    "startIndex": 185882,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "We are BULLISH on small businesses",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185918,
                    "startIndex": 185916,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185691
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185919,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185919,
                    "startIndex": 185918,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185918
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185945,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185945,
                    "startIndex": 185919,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Not investable, though.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185919
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 185946,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 185946,
                    "startIndex": 185945,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185945
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186072,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186072,
                    "startIndex": 185946,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In fact, the removal of barriers to entry through AI may be the solution to flatten the wealth divide that we currently face.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 185946
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186073,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186073,
                    "startIndex": 186072,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186072
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186558,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186512,
                    "startIndex": 186073,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Maybe. Though we must ask what the real, defensible moats are, post AI? Regulation is a very big one, and network efficiencies, but less brand where the human is not making the purchasing act. Often there are signs already of future trends already playing out. One example is Amazon being full of generic brands, and customers apparently not caring. We must also ask what kids will grow up doing differently? What other rules are there? ",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186557,
                    "startIndex": 186512,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Companies progress one resignation at a time.",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186558,
                    "startIndex": 186557,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186073
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186559,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186559,
                    "startIndex": 186558,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186558
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186770,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186770,
                    "startIndex": 186559,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The internet killed certain job categories but created entirely new ones. AI may follow a similar pattern, compressing some white-collar functions while expanding self-directed economic participation elsewhere.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186559
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186771,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186771,
                    "startIndex": 186770,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186770
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186794,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186794,
                    "startIndex": 186771,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "THE SaaS “DEATH” STORY\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186771
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 186795,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 186795,
                    "startIndex": 186794,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186794
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187028,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187028,
                    "startIndex": 186795,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI clearly pressures the traditional SaaS business model. Procurement teams are negotiating harder and some long-tail software products face structural headwinds. But SaaS is a delivery mechanism, not the endpoint of value creation.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 186795
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187029,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187029,
                    "startIndex": 187028,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187028
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187235,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187235,
                    "startIndex": 187029,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ They have conflated SaaS, the web delivery system, the payment system, and software. The SaaS implosion is a software implosion. It’s saying software is either dead or going to suffer margin compression.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187029
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187236,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187236,
                    "startIndex": 187235,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187235
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187429,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187295,
                    "startIndex": 187236,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The next generation of software is adaptive, agent-driven, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187308,
                    "startIndex": 187295,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "outcome-based",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187429,
                    "startIndex": 187308,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ", and deeply integrated. The winners will not be static tool providers, they will be those who can best adapt to change.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187236
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187430,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187430,
                    "startIndex": 187429,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187429
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187613,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187533,
                    "startIndex": 187430,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Every technological shift reorders the stack and the companies pricing static workflows WILL struggle. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187611,
                    "startIndex": 187533,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The companies owning data, trust, compute, energy, and verification may thrive",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187613,
                    "startIndex": 187611,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187430
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187614,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187614,
                    "startIndex": 187613,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187613
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187666,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187666,
                    "startIndex": 187614,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Not many companies own data or compute or energy.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187614
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187667,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187667,
                    "startIndex": 187666,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187666
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187777,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187777,
                    "startIndex": 187667,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Margin compression in one layer does not imply collapse of the entire digital economy. It signals transition.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187667
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187778,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187778,
                    "startIndex": 187777,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187777
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187810,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187810,
                    "startIndex": 187778,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI COMMERCE RESRUCTURES MARKETS\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187778
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187811,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187811,
                    "startIndex": 187810,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187810
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187980,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187980,
                    "startIndex": 187811,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The bearish narrative argues that agentic commerce destroys intermediation and eliminates fees. In part, it does. When friction declines, fee extraction becomes harder.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187811
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 187981,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 187981,
                    "startIndex": 187980,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187980
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188144,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188144,
                    "startIndex": 187981,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "As shown below, Stablecoin transaction volumes are already skyrocketing, even before AI became with it is today. Why? Because the market always favors efficiency.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 187981
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188145,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188145,
                    "startIndex": 188144,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188144
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188316,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188202,
                    "startIndex": 188145,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Lower systemic friction also expands transaction volume. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188316,
                    "startIndex": 188202,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "When price discovery improves and transaction costs fall, more economic activity occurs. This is a BULLISH trend.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188145
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188317,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188317,
                    "startIndex": 188316,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188316
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188507,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188507,
                    "startIndex": 188317,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Agents acting on behalf of consumers may compress margins for platforms built on habit. Yet, they can simultaneously increase total demand by lowering search costs and improving efficiency.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188317
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188508,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188508,
                    "startIndex": 188507,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188507
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188523,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188523,
                    "startIndex": 188508,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Yes, agreed.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188508
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188524,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188524,
                    "startIndex": 188523,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188523
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188558,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188558,
                    "startIndex": 188524,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "PRODUCTIVITY IS THE CORE VARIABLE\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188524
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188559,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188559,
                    "startIndex": 188558,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188558
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188827,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188827,
                    "startIndex": 188559,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The ultimate determinant of the optimistic outcome is productivity. If AI delivers sustained productivity gains across healthcare, government administration, logistics, manufacturing, and energy optimization, then the result is abundance and increased access for all.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188559
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188828,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188828,
                    "startIndex": 188827,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188827
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188929,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188929,
                    "startIndex": 188828,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ The original paper acknowledges this but is discussing the depression and mass layoffs beforehand.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188828
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 188930,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 188930,
                    "startIndex": 188929,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188929
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189021,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189021,
                    "startIndex": 188930,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Even a sustained 1–2% incremental productivity boost compounds dramatically over a decade.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 188930
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189022,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189022,
                    "startIndex": 189021,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189021
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189212,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189212,
                    "startIndex": 189022,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ The original article takes on the productivity boost but says it is a paradox because it is not helping people keep jobs or keeping up repayments. It is going to the owners of production.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189022
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189213,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189213,
                    "startIndex": 189212,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189212
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189599,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189599,
                    "startIndex": 189213,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The shifts we are seeing in the macroeconomy as a result of AI have resulted in some of the best investment opportunities in history. This is something we have spent countless hours on and continue to get ahead of. If you are interested in receiving our premium analysis and seeing how we are positioned in these times of disruption, see thekobeissiletter.com for more of our research.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189213
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189600,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189600,
                    "startIndex": 189599,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189599
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189767,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189767,
                    "startIndex": 189600,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ This is a celebration of good outcomes for certain stock holders, missing the general point. It is also missing the point that laid off people and bots don’t spend.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189600
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189768,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189768,
                    "startIndex": 189767,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189767
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189929,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189929,
                    "startIndex": 189768,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "As shown below, productivity is already growing at a rapid pace as a result of AI. US labor productivity accelerated Q3 2025 to its strongest pace in two years:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189768
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189930,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189930,
                    "startIndex": 189929,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189929
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189994,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189994,
                    "startIndex": 189930,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Yes, but white collar employment is not up. That’s the point.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189930
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 189995,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 189995,
                    "startIndex": 189994,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189994
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190238,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190238,
                    "startIndex": 189995,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The pessimistic view assumes productivity gains accrue exclusively to those who build the AI models and do not translate into broader benefits. The optimistic view assumes price compression and new market formation transmit gains more widely.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 189995
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190239,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190239,
                    "startIndex": 190238,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190238
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190282,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190282,
                    "startIndex": 190239,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "ABUNDANCE REDUCES CONFLICT, NOT JUST COSTS\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190239
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190283,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190283,
                    "startIndex": 190282,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190282
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190613,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190613,
                    "startIndex": 190283,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "One of the most under-discussed implications of AI-driven abundance is geopolitical. For most of modern history, wars have been fought over scarcity: energy, food, trade routes, industrial capacity, labor, and technology. Nations compete when resources are constrained and growth feels zero-sum. But abundance changes EVERYTHING.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190283
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190614,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190614,
                    "startIndex": 190613,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190613
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190672,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190672,
                    "startIndex": 190614,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ No, it’ll bring about bottlenecks in natural resources.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190614
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 190673,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 190673,
                    "startIndex": 190672,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190672
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191025,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191025,
                    "startIndex": 190673,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If AI materially lowers the cost of production across energy, manufacturing design, logistics, and services, the global pie expands. When productivity rises and marginal costs fall, economic growth becomes less dependent on extracting advantage from others. This will end wars, and potential result in some of the most peaceful times in human history.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 190673
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191026,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191026,
                    "startIndex": 191025,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191025
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191141,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191141,
                    "startIndex": 191026,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ If your throughput increases in production of goods made of molecules, you’re going to need lots more molecules.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191026
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191142,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191142,
                    "startIndex": 191141,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191141
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191226,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191226,
                    "startIndex": 191142,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The same goes with economic warfare, such as the year-long trade war we are in now.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191142
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191227,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191227,
                    "startIndex": 191226,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191226
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191490,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191490,
                    "startIndex": 191227,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Tariffs are tools of protection in a world where domestic industries struggle to compete on cost. But if AI collapses production costs everywhere, why would we need tariffs anymore? In a high-abundance environment, protectionism becomes economically inefficient.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191227
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191491,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191491,
                    "startIndex": 191490,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191490
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191697,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191592,
                    "startIndex": 191491,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "History shows that periods of technological acceleration often reduce global conflict in the long run",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.827451,
                              "green": 0.91764706,
                              "red": 0.8509804
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191697,
                    "startIndex": 191592,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". Post-World War II industrial expansion reduced incentives for direct confrontation among major powers.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191491
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191698,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191698,
                    "startIndex": 191697,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191697
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191812,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191812,
                    "startIndex": 191698,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ This is nonsense. We’ve had nothing but technological acceleration since 1800 and many wars of increasing size.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "bold": true
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191698
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191813,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191813,
                    "startIndex": 191812,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191812
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191844,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191844,
                    "startIndex": 191813,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Battle Deaths Decline Post-WW2\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191813
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 191845,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 191845,
                    "startIndex": 191844,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191844
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192129,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192129,
                    "startIndex": 191845,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI-driven abundance could accelerate that dynamic. If energy becomes more efficiently managed, supply chains more resilient, and production more localized through automation, nations become less vulnerable. When economic security rises, geopolitical aggression becomes less rational.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 191845
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192130,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192130,
                    "startIndex": 192129,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192129
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192273,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192273,
                    "startIndex": 192130,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The most optimistic AI outcome is not just higher productivity or higher equity indices. It is a world where economic growth is less zero-sum.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192130
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192274,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192274,
                    "startIndex": 192273,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192273
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192317,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192317,
                    "startIndex": 192274,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "CONCLUSION: WHAT IF THE WORLD DOESN'T END?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192274
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192318,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192318,
                    "startIndex": 192317,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192317
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192468,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192468,
                    "startIndex": 192318,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI amplifies outcomes. It can amplify fragility if institutions fail to adapt and it can also amplify prosperity if productivity outpaces disruption.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192318
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192469,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192469,
                    "startIndex": 192468,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192468
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192600,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192600,
                    "startIndex": 192469,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Anthropic takedowns are signals that workflows are being repriced and cognitive labor is becoming cheaper, a clear transition.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192469
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192601,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192601,
                    "startIndex": 192600,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192600
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 192723,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 192723,
                    "startIndex": 192601,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But transition is not the same as collapse as every major technological revolution has looked destabilizing at the start.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 192601
            },
            {
