              "startIndex": 197278
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 197540,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 197414,
                    "startIndex": 197279,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Spruce Pine as a Single Point of Failure: The reliance on ultra-pure quartz from North Carolina is a classic geopolitical choke point. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 197538,
                    "startIndex": 197414,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Financial history shows that such acute bottlenecks (like rubber in WW2) often dictate the speed of technological deployment",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
