                  {
                    "endIndex": 197811,
                    "startIndex": 197541,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Data Walls and Model Collapse: The exhaustion of high-quality human text is a real barrier. The transition to synthetic data introduces the risk of \"inbreeding\" in AI models, shifting the premium from raw compute to proprietary, high-fidelity real-world data pipelines.\n",
