                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 198083,
                    "startIndex": 197831,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The AI Engineer Shortage is Transient: The research positions AI deployment talent as a long-term bottleneck. However, AI is actively learning to code and deploy itself. The \"$4.5T Integration Gap\" will likely be solved by the very agents creating it, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 198123,
                    "startIndex": 198083,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "making MLOps a short-lived golden ticket",
