              "endIndex": 198776,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 198560,
                    "startIndex": 198530,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Jevons Paradox in Action: ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 198774,
                    "startIndex": 198560,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Kobeissi is right that cheaper cognition will lead to an explosion in demand for cognition. When the price of light dropped by 99% over the last century, we didn't spend less on lighting; we lit up the entire world",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
