              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 216212,
                    "startIndex": 216091,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ In some sense, it says European consumers trust Chinese more (and probably cannot remember what happened with Huawei).\n",
