            {
              "endIndex": 225270,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 225270,
                    "startIndex": 225054,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ I have long suspected Vitalik is a communist. His posts are very confusing in this regard. I think perhaps he thinks in mechanism design but perhaps with the intention to quell current capitalism’s worst effects. \n",
