            },
            {
              "endIndex": 252787,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 252787,
                    "startIndex": 252665,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It does sound as JD Vance is *preparing* MAGA voters for a *potential* strike — as he did just before the attack in June.\n",
