            {
              "endIndex": 310776,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 310776,
                    "startIndex": 310600,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This week, Anthropic delivered a master class in arrogance and betrayal as well as a textbook case of how not to do business with the United States Government or the Pentagon.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 310600
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 310777,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 310777,
                    "startIndex": 310776,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 310776
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 310965,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 310965,
                    "startIndex": 310777,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Our position has never wavered and will never waver: the Department of War must have full, unrestricted access to Anthropic’s models for every LAWFUL purpose in defense of the Republic.  \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 310777
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 310966,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 310966,
                    "startIndex": 310965,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 310965
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311284,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 311284,
                    "startIndex": 310966,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Instead, @AnthropicAI and its CEO @DarioAmodei, have chosen duplicity. Cloaked in the sanctimonious rhetoric of “effective altruism,” they have attempted to strong-arm the United States military into submission - a cowardly act of corporate virtue-signaling that places Silicon Valley ideology above American lives.  \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 310966
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311285,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 311285,
                    "startIndex": 311284,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 311284
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311439,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 311439,
                    "startIndex": 311285,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Terms of Service of Anthropic’s defective altruism will never outweigh the safety, the readiness, or the lives of American troops on the battlefield.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 311285
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311440,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 311440,
                    "startIndex": 311439,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 311439
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311582,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 311582,
                    "startIndex": 311440,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Their true objective is unmistakable: to seize veto power over the operational decisions of the United States military. That is unacceptable.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 311440
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 311584,
              "paragraph": {
