                          "weight": 400
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 11559,
                    "startIndex": 11310,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " The U.S. aims to return major oil companies like ExxonMobil and ConocoPhillips to the country. These companies could negotiate favorable profit-sharing agreements with the state oil company (PDVSA) to recover losses from previous nationalizations.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
                          "color": {
