                          "weight": 400
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 12012,
                    "startIndex": 11809,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " Currently, about 80% of Venezuelan oil goes to China. A U.S.-led transition would likely redirect this crude to U.S. refineries in the Gulf Coast (e.g., Louisiana), bolstering U.S. energy independence.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
