                          "weight": 400
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 12278,
                    "startIndex": 12068,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " A primary goal is to eject the \"axis of aggressors\"—China, Russia, and Iran—from the Western Hemisphere. These nations have used Venezuela as a strategic foothold to challenge U.S. interests near its borders.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
                          "color": {
