                          "weight": 400
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 12471,
                    "startIndex": 12308,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " The operation is seen as a reassertion of U.S. dominance in the Americas, sending a clear message to other antagonistic regimes like those in Cuba and Nicaragua.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
                          "color": {
