            {
              "endIndex": 15518,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 15516,
                    "startIndex": 15358,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Brexit didn't just change the UK; it changed the EU. For decades, the UK acted as a \"brake\" on European military integration, fearing it would undermine NATO.",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
