                  {
                    "endIndex": 16044,
                    "startIndex": 15700,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " In early 2026, we are seeing the \"strategic solitude\" of the UK. It is a leading military power in Europe, but it is not part of the EU's new decision-making core. This makes the UK feel more \"exposed\" to the whims of Washington, leading to the \"vibes\" of wanting to distance ourselves before we get dragged into something we can't influence.\n",
