                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " Because the UK is outside the EU's protective trade umbrella, it is more vulnerable to U.S. tariffs. This makes the \"Special Relationship\" feel less like a partnership and more like a \"transactional\" arrangement where the UK has very little leverage.\n",
