                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 17266,
                    "startIndex": 17019,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " If the U.S. continues to act without consulting allies (like in Venezuela), British thinkers worry that the UK will become a \"satellite state\"—providing the soldiers and the legitimacy for American actions without having any say in the strategy.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
