                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 17539,
                    "startIndex": 17285,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": " There is a growing sense that British values (international law, multilateralism, social welfare) are diverging so sharply from the current U.S. political direction that \"supporting U.S. strength\" feels like supporting a different world order entirely.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
