            {
              "endIndex": 17792,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 17792,
                    "startIndex": 17560,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Your point about the UK being the \"mother\" of the U.S. is poignant. In 2026, the mood is that of a parent who realizes their child has become significantly more powerful, more aggressive, and less interested in the parent's advice.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "foregroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.12156863,
                              "green": 0.12156863,
