              "endIndex": 34269,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34269,
                    "startIndex": 34099,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-ChatGPT will add digital advertising in its consumer product. The first iteration will not be great. The second version will improve. The third version will work great.\n",
