              "endIndex": 34391,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 34391,
                    "startIndex": 34270,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-A significant portion of the digital ad market will move to AI chatbots and AI consumer hardware, away from search ads.\n",
