                    "endIndex": 34675,
                    "startIndex": 34492,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ", which will dramatically lower its margins over the cycle. Serving the search index was a gold mine. That era will end. Timing is difficult. It may take a while, but it will happen.\n",
