                    "startIndex": 34676,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-All the talk about AGI and superintelligence is a distraction and a side show. AI adoption and AI progress will accelerate through 2026 as Gemini and Claude Opus proved scaling laws are intact. \n",
