              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 40673,
                    "startIndex": 40326,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ Big stench over this, but some are saying that they could quite literally pay off the inhabitants though they miss that they must buy the land from Denmark, and it is obviously valuable. The violence rhetoric is just posturing and Trump’s bullying tactic for softening up the Danes. It might be good for the rest of the West if the US owned it.\n",
