              "endIndex": 40861,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 40861,
                    "startIndex": 40828,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Why Denmark is (slightly) better\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 40828
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 40862,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 40862,
                    "startIndex": 40861,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 40861
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 41006,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 41006,
                    "startIndex": 40862,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Status quo stability. Denmark = predictable EU/NATO-aligned governance. Fewer shocks, fewer miscalculations. Markets and diplomacy like boring.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 40862
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 41007,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 41007,
                    "startIndex": 41006,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 41006
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 41219,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 41219,
                    "startIndex": 41007,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Lower escalation risk. US ownership would harden Arctic militarisation. That raises tail risks (missteps with Russia/China), which the UK disproportionately bears as a close US ally and European frontline state.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 41007
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 41220,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 41220,
                    "startIndex": 41219,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 41219
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 41393,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 41393,
                    "startIndex": 41220,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "EU alignment spillovers. Denmark’s control indirectly anchors Greenland to European norms. That helps UK–EU coordination on Arctic shipping, climate science, and fisheries.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 41220
            },
