                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56756
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56841,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56841,
                    "startIndex": 56757,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "My take on California’s “One-Time” Billionaire Tax.  It’s much worse than it looks.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56757
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56842,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56842,
                    "startIndex": 56841,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56841
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56874,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56874,
                    "startIndex": 56842,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "📉 Will it pass? Yes, likely.  \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56842
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56875,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56875,
                    "startIndex": 56874,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56874
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56969,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56969,
                    "startIndex": 56875,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It only needs 50%+1 voter approval. SEIU + CTA have done this before—Prop 55 won 63% in 2016.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56875
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 56970,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 56970,
                    "startIndex": 56969,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56969
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57008,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57008,
                    "startIndex": 56970,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "⚖️ Will it get tied up in litigation?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 56970
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57009,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57009,
                    "startIndex": 57008,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57008
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57164,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57164,
                    "startIndex": 57009,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Almost certainly. Retroactive wealth tax on a tax type CA has never had = due process challenges. Billionaires have the legal budgets for years of fights.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57009
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57165,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57165,
                    "startIndex": 57164,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57164
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57361,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57361,
                    "startIndex": 57165,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "👋 But it’s clearly … only the start.  The goal is an annual tax, not one-time.  And the target is $25m-50m net worth folks, including illiquid foldings (early stage founders raising a Series B).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57165
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57362,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57362,
                    "startIndex": 57361,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57361
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57413,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57413,
                    "startIndex": 57362,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The “one-time” framing is strategic, not terminal.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57362
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57414,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57414,
                    "startIndex": 57413,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57413
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57590,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57590,
                    "startIndex": 57414,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The same coalition (CTA, CFT, SEIU) already has AB 259 written—an >annual< 1% wealth tax at a >$50M threshold<, with plans to go to $25M. It’s been introduced 3 years running.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57414
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57591,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57591,
                    "startIndex": 57590,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57590
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57719,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57719,
                    "startIndex": 57591,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The one-time tax removes the constitutional barrier. Once that’s gone, the annual version becomes a much easier ballot measure.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57591
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57720,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57720,
                    "startIndex": 57719,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57719
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57911,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57911,
                    "startIndex": 57720,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "🔃 CA Policy Center said: “If SEIU hopes to keep Medi-Cal spending growing, it may need to place repeated wealth taxes on the ballot—potentially lowering the threshold as billionaires flee.”\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57720
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57912,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57912,
                    "startIndex": 57911,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57911
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57940,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57940,
                    "startIndex": 57912,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The real risk for founders:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57912
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 57941,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 57941,
                    "startIndex": 57940,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57940
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58089,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58089,
                    "startIndex": 57941,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "At $1B, you’re taxing ~200 people. At $50M, you’re taxing 23,000 households—including most successful founders on paper before any liquidity event.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 57941
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58090,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58090,
                    "startIndex": 58089,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 58089
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 58224,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 58224,
                    "startIndex": 58090,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The rational move isn’t to leave when you hit the threshold. It’s to leave—or never incorporate in CA—before you get anywhere close. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
