              },
              "startIndex": 79533
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 79550,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79550,
                    "startIndex": 79549,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 79549
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 79869,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79596,
                    "startIndex": 79550,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I have been posting repeatedly on X about the ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79653,
                    "startIndex": 79596,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "extraordinarily fast collapse of births across the planet",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79843,
                    "startIndex": 79653,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ": in rich and poor countries, in fast-growing and slow-growing economies, in religious and secular societies, under right-wing and left-wing governments, with high taxes and with low taxes. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79867,
                    "startIndex": 79843,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The pattern is universal",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.9490196,
                              "red": 1
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79869,
                    "startIndex": 79867,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 79550
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 79870,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 79870,
                    "startIndex": 79869,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 79869
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80180,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80180,
                    "startIndex": 79870,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I knew this trend would continue. Still, the figures released this morning left me genuinely speechless. China’s government announced on Monday (see screenshot below) that births in 2025 fell to 7.92 million, a staggering 1.62 million fewer than in 2024, and that the total fertility rate has dropped to 0.93.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 79870
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80181,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80181,
                    "startIndex": 80180,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80180
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80374,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80374,
                    "startIndex": 80181,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Few economists have been more forceful than yours truly in arguing that births are collapsing, yet even I was surprised by these numbers. I was forecasting around 8.5 million births, not 7.92.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80181
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80375,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80375,
                    "startIndex": 80374,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80374
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80794,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80408,
                    "startIndex": 80375,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "To put this into perspective: if ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80575,
                    "startIndex": 80408,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "China could somehow sustain 7.92 million births per year from now on, its population would eventually stabilize at roughly 625 million, far below today’s 1.405 billion",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80794,
                    "startIndex": 80575,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ". In reality, as smaller cohorts reach childbearing age, births will fall well below 7.92 million. Hence, 625 million is a very generous upper bound, even under implausibly optimistic assumptions about life expectancy.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80375
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80795,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80795,
                    "startIndex": 80794,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80794
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80917,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80812,
                    "startIndex": 80795,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Put differently, ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80865,
                    "startIndex": 80812,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "there were fewer births in China in 2025 than in 1776",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80917,
                    "startIndex": 80865,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ", the year the United States declared independence.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80795
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 80918,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80918,
                    "startIndex": 80917,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80917
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 81002,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 80962,
                    "startIndex": 80918,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I am still trying to process these numbers. ",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 81000,
                    "startIndex": 80962,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is the defining issue of our time",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.8,
                              "green": 0.8,
                              "red": 0.95686275
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 81002,
                    "startIndex": 81000,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 80918
            },
