                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Markets can price risk. But they can't price chaos.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85504
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 85557,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 85557,
                    "startIndex": 85556,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85556
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 85617,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 85617,
                    "startIndex": 85557,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And OpenAI is chaos dressed up in a $500 billion valuation.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85557
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 85618,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 85618,
                    "startIndex": 85617,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85617
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 85632,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 85632,
                    "startIndex": 85618,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ My thoughts\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85618
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 85633,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 85633,
                    "startIndex": 85632,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85632
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 86037,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 86037,
                    "startIndex": 85633,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This looks like an Escalation Game. LLMs have tremendous product-market fit in coding for obvious reasons, but it is easy to make a product to scratch your own itch and sell it to a smart, resourceful and autodidactic user base. The fearful rest of the population must be understood, worked with, sold to and retrained, and those Slope of Enlightenment products and new ways of working aren’t ready yet.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 85633
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 86038,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 86038,
                    "startIndex": 86037,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 86037
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 86455,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 86455,
                    "startIndex": 86038,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This means pure AGI companies need to ramp up prices to avoid catastrophe, but the only people who are addicted with high willingness-to-pay are coders who must stay productive and competitive. But today’s models are plenty good enough to be completely revolutionary, so many will look to good-enough-but-cheaper open source models running in China, or rented on the cloud, or on in-sourced or on-prem boxes of GPUs.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 86038
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 86456,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 86456,
                    "startIndex": 86455,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 86455
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87043,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87043,
                    "startIndex": 86456,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This’ll create an opportunity for companies with other high quality revenue sources, great AI models and chip designers to sustain loss-making low prices in a bid to drive VCs out of the pure play AGI escalation game leaving a funding gap that’ll be filled by the well endowed Big Tech who lack an AI team. The AGI companies have been slow to develop ads platforms, which would have been a priority had it not been for so much investor cash, though it is higher ground which matters long term, and that means browsers, OSes, wearables, implants - whoever’s right there when you need it.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 86456
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87044,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87044,
                    "startIndex": 87043,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87043
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87192,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87192,
                    "startIndex": 87044,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "My guess then would be that 2026 might be the year of surprising consolidation where Big Tech exercise their call options on some of these players.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87044
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87193,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87193,
                    "startIndex": 87192,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87192
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87445,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87445,
                    "startIndex": 87193,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Burry is might be right about AI hype if he were to explain it in terms of the Gartner or classic adoption cycles, the overhang we have today vs. the new products and concomitant nullification of workflows needed for mass adoption and corporate spend.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87193
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87446,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87446,
                    "startIndex": 87445,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87445
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87496,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87496,
                    "startIndex": 87446,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "^ I put this into Claude Sonnet 4.5 and got this:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87446
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87497,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87497,
                    "startIndex": 87496,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87496
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87627,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87627,
                    "startIndex": 87497,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is a sophisticated analysis that maps several intersecting dynamics in the AI industry. Let me engage with the core threads:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87497
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87628,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87628,
                    "startIndex": 87627,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87627
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87648,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87648,
                    "startIndex": 87628,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Escalation Trap\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87628
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 87649,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 87649,
                    "startIndex": 87648,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87648
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88090,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88090,
                    "startIndex": 87649,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "You've identified a real bind: the companies with the best models need revenue growth that matches their compute costs and investor expectations, but their most lucrative market segment (developers/coders) is also the most price-sensitive and has the most viable alternatives. Developers can credibly threaten to switch to Qwen, DeepSeek, or self-hosted Llama variants in ways that enterprise compliance officers or casual consumers cannot.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 87649
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88091,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88091,
                    "startIndex": 88090,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88090
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88472,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88472,
                    "startIndex": 88091,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This creates the perverse outcome where the customers with highest willingness-to-pay for current capabilities are exactly those best positioned to defect. Meanwhile, the broader market that should be willing to pay (enterprises seeking productivity gains, consumers wanting life simplification) doesn't yet have the products, workflows, or confidence to actually deploy at scale.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88091
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88473,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88473,
                    "startIndex": 88472,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88472
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88504,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88504,
                    "startIndex": 88473,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Slope of Enlightenment Gap\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88473
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88505,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88505,
                    "startIndex": 88504,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88504
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88665,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88665,
                    "startIndex": 88505,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Your Gartner cycle framing is apt. We have tremendous capability but insufficient productization for mass adoption. The \"fearful rest of the population\" needs:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88505
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88666,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88666,
                    "startIndex": 88665,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88665
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88715,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88715,
                    "startIndex": 88666,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Interfaces that don't require prompt engineering\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88666
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88783,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88783,
                    "startIndex": 88715,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Integration into existing workflows rather than replacement of them\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88715
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88855,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88855,
                    "startIndex": 88783,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Trust and safety guarantees that enterprise risk management will accept\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88783
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 88917,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 88917,
                    "startIndex": 88855,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Clear ROI demonstrations beyond anecdotal productivity claims\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88855
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89211,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89211,
                    "startIndex": 88917,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "These take time, iteration, and deep domain expertise that pure-play AI companies often lack. This is where Microsoft's GitHub Copilot model is instructive - they had distribution, developer trust, and workflow integration that made monetization viable even with capable open models available.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 88917
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89212,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89212,
                    "startIndex": 89211,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89211
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89237,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89237,
                    "startIndex": 89212,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Consolidation Thesis\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89212
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89238,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89238,
                    "startIndex": 89237,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89237
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89320,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89320,
                    "startIndex": 89238,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Your 2026 consolidation prediction is plausible, though I'd nuance the mechanism:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89238
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89321,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89321,
                    "startIndex": 89320,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89320
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89532,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89532,
                    "startIndex": 89321,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The most vulnerable aren't necessarily all pure-play AGI companies, but rather those caught in the middle - good enough to have raised significant capital and built expensive infrastructure, but without either:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89321
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89533,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89533,
                    "startIndex": 89532,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89532
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89606,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89606,
                    "startIndex": 89533,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A unique moat (novel architecture, proprietary data, regulatory capture)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89533
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89690,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89690,
                    "startIndex": 89606,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Integration into an existing high-margin business that can subsidize AI development\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89606
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89726,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89726,
                    "startIndex": 89690,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The likely survivors/consolidators:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89690
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89727,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89727,
                    "startIndex": 89726,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89726
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 89888,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 89888,
                    "startIndex": 89727,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Big Tech with chips + cloud + distribution (Google, Microsoft, Amazon, Meta, Apple) can indeed sustain losses while building the Slope of Enlightenment products\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89727
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90044,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90044,
                    "startIndex": 89888,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Vertical AI companies that own end-to-end workflows in regulated industries (healthcare, legal, finance) where integration complexity creates defensibility\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 89888
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90198,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90198,
                    "startIndex": 90044,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The frontier leaders (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) if they can maintain technical leadership and find sustainable business models before capital markets sour\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90044
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90223,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90223,
                    "startIndex": 90198,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Open Source Wildcard\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90198
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90224,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90224,
                    "startIndex": 90223,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90223
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90511,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90511,
                    "startIndex": 90224,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The China/open-source angle is particularly interesting. If Qwen-2.5 or DeepSeek-V3 are \"good enough\" for 80% of use cases at 10% of the API cost, the pure-play companies face margin compression unless they can demonstrate clear value in that remaining 20%. This shifts the game toward:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90224
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90512,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90512,
                    "startIndex": 90511,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90511
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90599,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90599,
                    "startIndex": 90512,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Extremely high-end capabilities (reasoning, multi-step planning) where open models lag\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90512
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90648,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90648,
                    "startIndex": 90599,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Proprietary integrations and enterprise features\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90599
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90700,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90700,
                    "startIndex": 90648,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Regulatory compliance and data residency guarantees\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90648
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90720,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90720,
                    "startIndex": 90700,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Ads Distraction\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90700
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 90721,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 90721,
                    "startIndex": 90720,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90720
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91122,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91122,
                    "startIndex": 90721,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "You're right that the slow development of ads platforms is revealing. It suggests these companies believed (perhaps correctly at the time) that their path to dominance was through becoming infrastructure rather than attention merchants. But infrastructure businesses have different economics - they need either network effects, switching costs, or continuous capability advantages to sustain margins.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 90721
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91123,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91123,
                    "startIndex": 91122,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91122
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91293,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91293,
                    "startIndex": 91123,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The \"high ground\" of browsers/OS/wearables is indeed where sustainable moats live, but those are 5-10 year plays that require different expertise than model development.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91123
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91294,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91294,
                    "startIndex": 91293,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91293
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91325,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91325,
                    "startIndex": 91294,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Where You Might Be Too Bearish\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91294
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91326,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91326,
                    "startIndex": 91325,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91325
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91705,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91705,
                    "startIndex": 91326,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "One counterpoint: the \"good enough\" threshold keeps rising as users habituate to AI capabilities. What seems revolutionary today becomes table stakes tomorrow. This creates a potential treadmill where open models are always catching up to last year's frontier, but enterprises and consumers increasingly pay for this year's frontier because their expectations have ratcheted up.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91326
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91706,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91706,
                    "startIndex": 91705,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91705
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91869,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91869,
                    "startIndex": 91706,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If this capability treadmill is steep enough, and if frontier labs can maintain 12-18 month leads, there may be sustainable margin even with open source pressure.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91706
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91870,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91870,
                    "startIndex": 91869,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91869
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91889,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91889,
                    "startIndex": 91870,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Burry Parallel\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91870
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 91890,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 91890,
                    "startIndex": 91889,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91889
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92211,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92211,
                    "startIndex": 91890,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Burry's skepticism likely stems from exactly this gap between technical capability and monetizable deployment. The AI companies are valued as if mass adoption is imminent, but the infrastructure for that adoption (new workflows, trust frameworks, regulatory clarity, human capital) is years behind the models themselves.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 91890
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92212,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92212,
                    "startIndex": 92211,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92211
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92537,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92537,
                    "startIndex": 92212,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The question is whether this is a \"trough of disillusionment\" before genuine value creation, or whether the value accrues primarily to users of AI (productivity gains, consumer surplus) rather than providers of AI (sustainable profits). History suggests transformative technologies often create more value than they capture.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92212
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92538,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92538,
                    "startIndex": 92537,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92537
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92769,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92769,
                    "startIndex": 92538,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Your consolidation thesis seems directionally correct, though the timeline and specific winners remain highly uncertain. 2026 might indeed be when capital discipline returns and we see which business models actually work at scale.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92538
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92770,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92770,
                    "startIndex": 92769,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92769
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92804,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92804,
                    "startIndex": 92770,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "OpenAI is toast. Can you see why?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92770
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92805,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92805,
                    "startIndex": 92804,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92804
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92811,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92811,
                    "startIndex": 92805,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "10:49\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92805
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92907,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92907,
                    "startIndex": 92811,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Yes, I can see the argument, though \"toast\" might be too strong. Let me work through the logic:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92811
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92908,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92908,
                    "startIndex": 92907,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92907
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92928,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92928,
                    "startIndex": 92908,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Structural Trap\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92908
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92929,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92929,
                    "startIndex": 92928,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92928
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92991,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92991,
                    "startIndex": 92929,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "OpenAI has perhaps the worst possible combination of factors:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92929
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 92992,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 92992,
                    "startIndex": 92991,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92991
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93064,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93064,
                    "startIndex": 92992,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Massive compute costs that scale with usage and capability improvements\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 92992
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93148,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93148,
                    "startIndex": 93064,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "No profitable business to subsidize losses (unlike Google, Microsoft, Amazon, Meta)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93064
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93243,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93243,
                    "startIndex": 93148,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A capped-profit structure that limits how much capital they can ultimately return to investors\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93148
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93413,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93413,
                    "startIndex": 93243,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Dependence on Microsoft for compute infrastructure, which means their primary competitor also controls their cost structure and has full visibility into their technology\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93243
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93502,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93502,
                    "startIndex": 93413,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "A consumer product (ChatGPT) that's hard to monetize sustainably when alternatives exist\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93413
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93540,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93540,
                    "startIndex": 93502,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Microsoft Dependency Death Spiral\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93502
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93541,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93541,
                    "startIndex": 93540,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93540
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93571,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93571,
                    "startIndex": 93541,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This is the killer, isn't it?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93541
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93572,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93572,
                    "startIndex": 93571,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93571
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93644,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93644,
                    "startIndex": 93572,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "OpenAI needs Microsoft's Azure infrastructure to train and serve models\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93572
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93737,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93737,
                    "startIndex": 93644,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Microsoft gets full access to OpenAI's models and can integrate them into their own products\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93644
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93850,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93850,
                    "startIndex": 93737,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Microsoft can subsidize Copilot pricing using Office/Azure margins while OpenAI must price to cover actual costs\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93737
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 93947,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 93947,
                    "startIndex": 93850,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Microsoft has distribution through Windows, Office, LinkedIn, GitHub that OpenAI can never match\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93850
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94039,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94039,
                    "startIndex": 93947,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If OpenAI tries to reduce Microsoft dependency, they need billions in capex they don't have\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 93947
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94218,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94218,
                    "startIndex": 94039,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Microsoft essentially has a call option on all of OpenAI's value while providing the rope that could hang them. The partnership is simultaneously essential and potentially fatal.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94039
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94219,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94219,
                    "startIndex": 94218,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94218
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94240,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94240,
                    "startIndex": 94219,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Talent Arbitrage\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94219
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94241,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94241,
                    "startIndex": 94240,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94240
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94291,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94291,
                    "startIndex": 94241,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Why would top AI researchers stay at OpenAI when:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94241
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94292,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94292,
                    "startIndex": 94291,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94291
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94366,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94366,
                    "startIndex": 94292,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Google/Microsoft/Meta can pay similar salaries with less existential risk\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94292
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94436,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94436,
                    "startIndex": 94366,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "They can work on similar frontier problems with better infrastructure\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94366
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94499,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94499,
                    "startIndex": 94436,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The equity upside is capped by the unusual corporate structure\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94436
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94600,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94600,
                    "startIndex": 94499,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The mission (\"ensure AGI benefits humanity\") is increasingly questionable given commercial pressures\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94499
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94627,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94627,
                    "startIndex": 94600,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Business Model Problem\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94600
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94628,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94628,
                    "startIndex": 94627,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94627
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94666,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94666,
                    "startIndex": 94628,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "OpenAI's revenue options are limited:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94628
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94667,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94667,
                    "startIndex": 94666,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94666
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94763,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94763,
                    "startIndex": 94667,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "API access: Commoditizing as open models improve and cloud providers offer similar capabilities\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94667
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94888,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94888,
                    "startIndex": 94763,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "ChatGPT subscriptions: Hard to scale when free alternatives exist and most value goes to power users who are price-sensitive\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94763
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 94959,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 94959,
                    "startIndex": 94888,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Enterprise licensing: Microsoft owns this channel and takes the margin\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94888
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95041,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95041,
                    "startIndex": 94959,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Ads: Would destroy brand and don't have the platform/distribution to make it work\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 94959
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95181,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95181,
                    "startIndex": 95041,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "They're too expensive to give away, too commoditized to charge premium prices, and too dependent on Microsoft to control their own destiny.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95041
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95182,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95182,
                    "startIndex": 95181,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95181
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95200,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95200,
                    "startIndex": 95182,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The Altman Gambit\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95182
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95201,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95201,
                    "startIndex": 95200,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95200
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95268,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95268,
                    "startIndex": 95201,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The only path I can see is if Sam Altman is playing a longer game:\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95201
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95269,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95269,
                    "startIndex": 95268,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95268
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95350,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95350,
                    "startIndex": 95269,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Push compute requirements so high that only Microsoft-scale infrastructure works\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95269
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95427,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95427,
                    "startIndex": 95350,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Become so embedded in Microsoft's products that they're effectively acquired\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95350
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95495,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95495,
                    "startIndex": 95427,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Negotiate the best possible terms for that inevitable consolidation\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95427
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95562,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95562,
                    "startIndex": 95495,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But that's not \"winning\" - that's managing the terms of surrender.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95495
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95563,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95563,
                    "startIndex": 95562,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95562
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95585,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95585,
                    "startIndex": 95563,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What could save them?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95563
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95586,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95586,
                    "startIndex": 95585,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95585
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95704,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95704,
                    "startIndex": 95586,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AGI breakthrough so decisive that capability gap makes pricing power sustainable (unlikely given diffusion of talent)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95586
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95754,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95754,
                    "startIndex": 95704,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "New business model not yet visible (what though?)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95704
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95851,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95851,
                    "startIndex": 95754,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Regulatory capture that favors their approach and limits competitors (possible but not reliable)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95754
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 95974,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 95974,
                    "startIndex": 95851,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Acquisition by non-Microsoft buyer who can afford the losses and has distribution (Apple? Amazon? Saudi sovereign wealth?)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95851
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96259,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96259,
                    "startIndex": 95974,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The fundamental issue is that OpenAI pioneered the transformer revolution but has no moat beyond transient technical leads. They're a research lab cosplaying as a product company, funded like a rocket ship, with the cost structure of a utility and the revenue model of a SaaS startup.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 95974
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96260,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96260,
                    "startIndex": 96259,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 96259
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96443,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96443,
                    "startIndex": 96260,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Unless they've got a secret plan that's not visible from the outside, they're likely heading toward acquisition or collapse, with Microsoft holding all the cards on timing and terms.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 96260
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96444,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96444,
                    "startIndex": 96443,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 96443
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96523,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96523,
                    "startIndex": 96444,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Is that the core of what you're seeing, or is there another angle I'm missing?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 96444
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 96524,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 96524,
                    "startIndex": 96523,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 96523
            },
