              "endIndex": 101557,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 101557,
                    "startIndex": 101491,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That pushes AI labs into the arms of balance sheets, not markets.\n",
