                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 132354
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 132550,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 132550,
                    "startIndex": 132549,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 132549
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 132773,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 132773,
                    "startIndex": 132550,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And homework isn't just optional, it's fundamentally different. No more mystery assignments, no more 3-hour homework nights. Want to skip homework for a family event? Fine. Kid wants to work ahead over break? Also fine. 3/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 132550
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 132774,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 132774,
                    "startIndex": 132773,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 132773
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133051,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133051,
                    "startIndex": 132774,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What surprised me: How differently Alpha works for each of our twins. Our son thrives on the incentive structures and lack of distractions. Our daughter is filling some learning gaps beyond what regular school could achieve. Both enjoy the afternoons and optional homework. 4/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 132774
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133052,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133052,
                    "startIndex": 133051,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133051
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133318,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133318,
                    "startIndex": 133052,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Afternoon workshops teach things I wish I'd learned in school: giving/receiving feedback, public speaking, self-learning (kids had to teach themselves to solve a Rubik's cube). Once you see these skills taught explicitly, it seems crazy that other schools don't. 5/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133052
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133319,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133319,
                    "startIndex": 133318,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133318
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133578,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133578,
                    "startIndex": 133319,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The social concern everyone asks about: There's still lunch, recess, breaks. But the *structured* social learning is great, like town halls where kids debate and vote, group projects, and workshops on interviewing strangers. It's not just screens all day. 6/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133319
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133579,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133579,
                    "startIndex": 133578,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133578
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133821,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133821,
                    "startIndex": 133579,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Prospective parents always ask me what has been bad so far. It’s a very fair question but I struggle for an answer; there’ve been hiccups but nothing that I’d call “bad.” The biggest unknown is whether quality holds as they scale quickly. 7/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133579
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133822,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133822,
                    "startIndex": 133821,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133821
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 133999,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 133999,
                    "startIndex": 133822,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The strongest signal: Of ~20 day-one NYC families, three have already enrolled a second child. The people who've seen it up close are giving the ultimate vote of confidence. 8/\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133822
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 134000,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 134000,
                    "startIndex": 133999,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 133999
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 134191,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 134191,
                    "startIndex": 134000,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Alpha School has been controversial for “replacing teachers with AI.” From the inside, this concern is bizarre. Adults at Alpha are just as important and just as present as in other schools.\n",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 134000
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 134192,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 134192,
                    "startIndex": 134191,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 134191
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 134384,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 134384,
                    "startIndex": 134192,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Our kids now say things like \"I like Alpha 20 times more than my other schools.\" The future of education will look more like this. We're very grateful that our kids get to experience it now. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 134192
            },
