              },
              "startIndex": 135010
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135084,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135084,
                    "startIndex": 135011,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "It’s been a month since our last missive on silver. A month ago was 45%.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135011
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135085,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135085,
                    "startIndex": 135084,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135084
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135133,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135133,
                    "startIndex": 135085,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Remember when I said it was about to get scary?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135085
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135134,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135134,
                    "startIndex": 135133,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135133
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135556,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135556,
                    "startIndex": 135134,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In the past year, the silver trade has gone from a backwater, to an interesting bull run, to a generational move. The dynamics we laid out years ago — inelastic demand from solar, inelastic supply from mining dynamics, Veblen-like speculative flows, strategic buying from investors diversifying out of dollars, capital flight from EMs with questionable banking systems, and strategic stockpiling — are all in full flight.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135134
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135557,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135557,
                    "startIndex": 135556,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135556
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135808,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135808,
                    "startIndex": 135557,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "And yet, the rally feels less like a party and more like a doomsday clock. Not for silver — for the dollar and the global order that’s been built on it. An indicator that the world our children will inhabit will look nothing like that of our parents.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135557
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 135809,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 135809,
                    "startIndex": 135808,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135808
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136186,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136186,
                    "startIndex": 135809,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Options are pricing >4% daily moves for the next couple months, and 3% moves for the foreseeable future. This has been backed up by realized vol. The only two times in recorded history where silver was realizing more volatility were 1981 during the Hunt squeeze, and the American Revolution (where the vol was the local currency collapsing vs the pound, not the metal moving).\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 135809
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136187,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136187,
                    "startIndex": 136186,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136186
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136384,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136384,
                    "startIndex": 136187,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Gold vol has picked up too — consistent with the broader debasement trade, diversification flows out of EM currencies, and folks hunting for alternatives to Treasuries in their reserve portfolios.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136187
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136385,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136385,
                    "startIndex": 136384,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136384
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136572,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136572,
                    "startIndex": 136385,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Long story short: We’ve diversified back into gold, liquidated a little over half our butterflies when they went through the middle strike last week, and are maintaining a long position.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136385
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136573,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136573,
                    "startIndex": 136572,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136572
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136729,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136729,
                    "startIndex": 136573,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "While keeping our shorts on US stocks, US bonds/credit, and a small long dollar position to hedge some of the short dollar embedded in our metals exposure.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136573
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136730,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136730,
                    "startIndex": 136729,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136729
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136750,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136750,
                    "startIndex": 136730,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "What’s Driving This\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136730
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136751,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136751,
                    "startIndex": 136750,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136750
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136874,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136874,
                    "startIndex": 136751,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "China capital flight remains the core short term driver in a market with a structural supply deficit from solar/AI demand.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136751
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 136875,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 136875,
                    "startIndex": 136874,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136874
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137304,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137304,
                    "startIndex": 136875,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Remember how we got into this trade — hunting for assets that would appreciate from Chinese capital flight. Including recycling, there’s only ~1bn oz of silver supply per year. At $100/oz that’s a $100bn market. The Chinese money machine prints around $3tr a year in bank deposits. Now that the secret is out that property is not a safe store of wealth, you only need a tiny shift in savings behavior to break the silver market.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 136875
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137305,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137305,
                    "startIndex": 137304,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137304
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137332,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137332,
                    "startIndex": 137305,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "That’s what you’re seeing.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137305
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137333,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137333,
                    "startIndex": 137332,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137332
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137635,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137635,
                    "startIndex": 137333,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "If you’re a rich Chinese household, do you want more money in a zombie banking system with trillions of hidden losses? Or are you okay buying physical silver at elevated levels and risking a 30% drawdown? The answer is obvious when your alternative is a deposit in a bank that’s technically insolvent.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137333
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137636,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137636,
                    "startIndex": 137635,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137635
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137743,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137743,
                    "startIndex": 137636,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Chinese property bonds are selling off again. Equity in our “worst banks in China” basket is rolling over.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137636
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137744,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137744,
                    "startIndex": 137743,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137743
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137800,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137800,
                    "startIndex": 137744,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Industrial Bank or The Worst (Big) Bank in China (2021)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137744
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137801,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137801,
                    "startIndex": 137800,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137800
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137953,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137953,
                    "startIndex": 137801,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "India and the Middle East are piling in too. If you're an Indian oligarch, do you want to hold wealth in a currency down 20%+ vs the dollar since 2020?\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137801
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 137954,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 137954,
                    "startIndex": 137953,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137953
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138271,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138271,
                    "startIndex": 137954,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "European institutions are finally waking up. If you're a European pension fund with 40% in US bonds and stocks — many illiquid and overmarked (cough: PE, VC, private credit) — you've been underweight metals for years. Now you have political reasons to diversify AND your investors are asking why you missed the move.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 137954
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138272,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138272,
                    "startIndex": 138271,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 138271
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138476,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138476,
                    "startIndex": 138272,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Official purchases feel inevitable. Asian demand seems inexhaustible. The rebalancing trade that put brakes on retail demand at year-end is behind us. ETF flows are strong but still below historic highs.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 138272
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138477,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138477,
                    "startIndex": 138476,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 138476
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138586,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138586,
                    "startIndex": 138477,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "At this point, it feels like a matter of when, not if, governments start building strategic silver reserves.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 138477
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138587,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138587,
                    "startIndex": 138586,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 138586
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 138608,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 138608,
                    "startIndex": 138587,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Why We’re Still Long\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
