                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 145942,
                    "startIndex": 145664,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\"Europeans are now clearly a history taker rather than a history maker. The lead actor of world affairs for five centuries has been reduced to a mere bystander, a key dynamo of historical change transformed into a potted plant.\" Excellent by the always brilliant @adwooldridge.\n",
