                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 160551,
                    "startIndex": 160259,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"A country of geniuses in a datacenter could […] participate peacefully in the global economy, [and] could still create severe risks simply by being so technologically advanced and effective that it disrupts the global economy, causing mass unemployment or radically concentrating wealth.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 160259
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 160552,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 160552,
                    "startIndex": 160551,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 160551
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 160610,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 160610,
                    "startIndex": 160552,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "### From Section 4 – \"Player piano\" (Economic disruption)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 160552
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 160907,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 160907,
                    "startIndex": 160610,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"the most obvious effect will be to greatly increase economic growth. The pace of advances in scientific research, biomedical innovation, manufacturing, supply chains, the efficiency of the financial system, and much more are almost guaranteed to lead to a much faster rate of economic growth.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 160610
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161014,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 160910,
                    "startIndex": 160907,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161011,
                    "startIndex": 160910,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "In Machines of Loving Grace, I suggest that a 10–20% sustained annual GDP growth rate may be possible",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161014,
                    "startIndex": 161011,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 160907
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161189,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161189,
                    "startIndex": 161014,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"I warned [in 2025] that AI could displace half of all entry-level white collar jobs in the next 1–5 years, even as it accelerates economic growth and scientific progress.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161014
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161277,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161277,
                    "startIndex": 161189,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"my prediction for 50% of entry level white collar jobs being disrupted is 1–5 years\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161189
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161449,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161449,
                    "startIndex": 161277,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"even though I suspect we’ll have powerful AI (which would be, technologically speaking, enough to do most or all jobs, not just entry level) in much less than 5 years.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161277
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161646,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161646,
                    "startIndex": 161449,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"AI will have effects that are much broader and occur much faster [than previous technological revolutions], and therefore I worry it will be much more challenging to make things work out well.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161449
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161732,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161732,
                    "startIndex": 161646,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"the short-term transition will be unusually painful compared to past technologies\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161646
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 161855,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161855,
                    "startIndex": 161732,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"the pace may if anything continue to speed up, as AI coding models increasingly accelerate the task of AI development.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161732
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162055,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 161858,
                    "startIndex": 161855,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162052,
                    "startIndex": 161858,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "AI is increasingly matching the general cognitive profile of humans, which means it will also be good at the new jobs that would ordinarily be created in response to the old ones being automated",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162055,
                    "startIndex": 162052,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 161855
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162155,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162155,
                    "startIndex": 162055,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"AI isn’t a substitute for specific human jobs but rather a general labor substitute for humans.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162055
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162236,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162236,
                    "startIndex": 162155,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"AI appears to be advancing from the bottom of the ability ladder to the top.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162155
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162301,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162301,
                    "startIndex": 162236,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"they could form an unemployed or very-low-wage 'underclass.'\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162236
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162497,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162497,
                    "startIndex": 162301,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"sufficiently powerful AI will be able to accelerate the development of robots, and then control those robots in the physical world. It may buy some time […] but I’m worried it won’t buy much.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162301
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162626,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162626,
                    "startIndex": 162497,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"even if the disruption was limited only to cognitive tasks, it would still be an unprecedentedly large and rapid disruption.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162497
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162714,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162714,
                    "startIndex": 162626,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"Enterprise AI adoption is growing at rates much faster than any previous technology\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162626
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 162870,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162870,
                    "startIndex": 162714,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"startups will spring up to serve as 'glue' and make the adoption easier. If that doesn’t work, the startups may simply disrupt the incumbents directly.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162714
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 163129,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 162873,
                    "startIndex": 162870,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163126,
                    "startIndex": 162873,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "This could also lead to a world of 'geographic inequality,' where an increasing fraction of the world’s wealth is concentrated in Silicon Valley, which becomes its own economy running at a different speed than the rest of the world and leaving it behind",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163129,
                    "startIndex": 163126,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 162870
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 163258,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163258,
                    "startIndex": 163129,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"All of these outcomes would be great for economic growth—but not so great for the labor market or those who are left behind.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 163129
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 163558,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163558,
                    "startIndex": 163258,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"if AIs are literally thousands of times more productive than humans, this logic [of comparative advantage] starts to break down. Even tiny transaction costs could make it not worth it for AI to trade with humans. And human wages may be very low, even if they technically have something to offer.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 163258
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 163836,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163561,
                    "startIndex": 163558,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163833,
                    "startIndex": 163561,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "in a world with enormous total wealth, in which many companies increase greatly in value due to increased productivity and capital concentration, it may be feasible to pay human employees even long after they are no longer providing economic value in the traditional sense",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 163836,
                    "startIndex": 163833,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 163558
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164001,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164001,
                    "startIndex": 163836,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"Extreme wealth concentration is already happening (Musk ~$700B > Rockefeller's historical ~2% GDP benchmark) and will reach trillions for individuals/companies.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 163836
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164129,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164129,
                    "startIndex": 164001,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"we are already at historically unprecedented levels of wealth concentration, even before most of the economic impact of AI.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164001
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164392,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164132,
                    "startIndex": 164129,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164389,
                    "startIndex": 164132,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I don’t think it is too much of a stretch […] to imagine AI companies, semiconductor companies, and perhaps downstream application companies generating ~$3T in revenue per year, being valued at ~$30T, and leading to personal fortunes well into the trillions",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164392,
                    "startIndex": 164389,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164129
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164474,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164474,
                    "startIndex": 164392,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"AI datacenters already represent a substantial fraction of US economic growth\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164392
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164647,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164647,
                    "startIndex": 164474,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"datacenter spending represents growth caused by anticipatory investment that amounts to the market expecting future AI-driven economic growth and investing accordingly.\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164474
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164922,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164650,
                    "startIndex": 164647,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164848,
                    "startIndex": 164650,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "the coupling of this economic concentration of wealth with the political system already concerns me. […] We already see this through the reluctance of tech companies to criticize the US government, ",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9529412,
                              "green": 0.8862745,
                              "red": 0.8117647
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164919,
                    "startIndex": 164848,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "and the government’s support for extreme anti-regulatory policies on AI",
                      "textStyle": {
                        "backgroundColor": {
                          "color": {
                            "rgbColor": {
                              "blue": 0.9098039,
                              "green": 0.77254903,
                              "red": 0.62352943
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164922,
                    "startIndex": 164919,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": ".\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164647
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164923,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164923,
                    "startIndex": 164922,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164922
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 164993,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 164993,
                    "startIndex": 164923,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "### From the concluding sections (Humanity’s test / indirect effects)\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164923
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 165089,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 165089,
                    "startIndex": 164993,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"We will likely get a 'century of scientific and economic progress compressed into a decade'\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 164993
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 165137,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 165137,
                    "startIndex": 165089,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- \"in the end AI will be able to do everything\"\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 165089
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 165138,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 165138,
                    "startIndex": 165137,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 165137
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 165400,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 165400,
                    "startIndex": 165138,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "These are the direct economic statements and forecasts as they appear in the original essay text (January 2026). No interpretations or summaries have been added beyond minor ellipses for brevity where the full sentence is not essential to the prediction itself.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 165138
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 165401,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 165401,
                    "startIndex": 165400,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 165400
            },
            {
