                      "content": "Meta is aggressively betting that controlling frontier AI models + owning massive efficient compute infrastructure + fusing LLMs with its unique social/recommendation data moat will allow it to (a) materially upgrade the core ads & engagement business, (b) create a new personal AI/agent layer, (c) open post-video immersive content formats, and (d) transition to AI glasses as the dominant future device category — while accepting very large 2025–2027+ investments and still-meaningful Reality Labs losses to position for that multi-year compounding cycle.\n",
