              "startIndex": 176348
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 176763,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 176763,
                    "startIndex": 176349,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "- AI is going to make smart people who work hard 10x more effective (and therefore worth even more), but it likely means the intelligence bar to be economically useful is going up. A college degree where you can write an email and take notes in a mtg is basically worthless now (this used to be fairly valuable - think account management or back-office ops). You're not employable with just those skills anymore. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 176349
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 176764,
              "paragraph": {
