                      "content": "BREAKING: Spot silver falls as much as -35%, dropping below $75/oz, on track for its biggest daily decline in 46 years.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178750
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 178871,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 178871,
                    "startIndex": 178870,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178870
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 178873,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 178873,
                    "startIndex": 178871,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "-\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178871
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 178874,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 178874,
                    "startIndex": 178873,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178873
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 178987,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 178987,
                    "startIndex": 178874,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "We have had computers talking to other computers for decades in the deterministic language of computer networks.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178874
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 178988,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 178988,
                    "startIndex": 178987,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178987
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 179161,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 179161,
                    "startIndex": 178988,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "I do think there are *some* possibilities opened up by probabilistic computer-to-computer communication via natural language. Software testing and fuzzing is one use case. \n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 178988
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 179162,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 179162,
                    "startIndex": 179161,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 179161
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 179355,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 179355,
                    "startIndex": 179162,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "But beyond that, the utility of AI agents interacting may be less than people think. By default it is just AIs spamming each other, trained on roughly the same overall corpus of internet text.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 179162
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 179356,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 179356,
                    "startIndex": 179355,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 179355
            },
            {
              "endIndex": 179465,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "endIndex": 179465,
                    "startIndex": 179356,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "The human-provided prompts are the novel inputs. And they are at the edges of the network, not the interior.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
                }
              },
              "startIndex": 179356
            },
